.honda.com','guest463','2008-05-04 23:10:28','great cars!'),(4289,'www.themumbaiindians.com','yapper','2008-05-04 23:54:25','cricket is big business in india'),(4290,'www.themumbaiindians.com','mv','2008-05-04 23:55:22','The most costly team too @ $112M !'),(4291,'www.themumbaiindians.com','yapper','2008-05-04 23:55:44','yah, reliance bough it for 112M$'),(4292,'www.themumbaiindians.com','mv','2008-05-04 23:56:01','from the worlds fifth richest man'),(4293,'www.themumbaiindians.com','yapper','2008-05-04 23:56:25','yah, wonder how they are going to make their money back'),(4294,'www.themumbaiindians.com','yapper','2008-05-04 23:56:49','the team does have sachin there'),(4295,'www.themumbaiindians.com','yapper','2008-05-04 23:57:01','as captain, which is great'),(4296,'www.themumbaiindians.com','mv','2008-05-04 23:57:09','Do you guys know if Sachin has recovered from injury?'),(4297,'www.themumbaiindians.com','yapper','2008-05-04 23:58:20','i did not know he is injured'),(4298,'www.themumbaiindians.com','yapper','2008-05-04 23:58:25','what happened to him'),(4299,'www.themumbaiindians.com','guest3848','2008-05-04 23:59:37','YAY! BREAK OUT THE CHAMPAGNE!'),(4300,'www.themumbaiindians.com','yapper','2008-05-05 00:00:57','YAY, champange indeed'),(4301,'www.themumbaiindians.com','yapper','2008-05-05 00:01:01','we are live'),(4302,'www.themumbaiindians.com','guest8200','2008-05-05 00:01:35','whew.'),(4303,'www.themumbaiindians.com','guest8200','2008-05-05 00:01:37','this is cool'),(4304,'www.themumbaiindians.com','mv','2008-05-05 00:01:44','Check out their TVC ad/ pretty cool'),(4305,'www.themumbaiindians.com','guest3848','2008-05-05 00:01:46','yup'),(4306,'www.themumbaiindians.com','guest3848','2008-05-05 00:01:55','tvc?'),(4307,'www.themumbaiindians.com','alvin','2008-05-05 00:02:04','Hey, it\'s still up.'),(4308,'www.themumbaiindians.com','mv','2008-05-05 00:02:26','Yeah. On the left navigation panel'),(4309,'www.themumbaiindians.com','edaimler','2008-05-05 00:02:45','h