r+Pakistan,+will+it+be+India?','guest6172','2008-09-13 13:13:53','Pakistani sympathisers have done it to help Pakistan\\\'s case in worls cricket or at least that is what they are trying to say now that India is an equally vulnerable country.'),(8726,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=a4425d9c-47e8-4dda-b07a-70b5c035853a&&IsCricket=true&Headline=After+Pakistan,+will+it+be+India?','guest6172','2008-09-13 13:15:03','Pakistani supporters trying to prove that cricket should be played in pakistan because bombings happen everywhere!!!'),(8727,'dogtimemedia.com','guest4300','2008-09-13 16:44:32','ha'),(8728,'dogtimemedia.com','guest4300','2008-09-13 16:45:07','anyone'),(8729,'hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?id=70b0a767-57a6-4576-80df-cadb59fce296','guest3594','2008-09-13 19:39:16','khalid mohammad is a scumbag'),(8730,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=4c3b004a-b029-42de-b305-859bbb2aaa18&&Headline=Blasts+a+war+against+the+country:+BJP&strParent=strParentID','guest8651','2008-09-13 19:39:40','anyone home'),(8731,'dogtimemedia.com','guest3462','2008-09-13 23:31:58','i have a german sheppard... she\\\'s soo gawjuz!'),(8732,'dogtimemedia.com','guest3462','2008-09-13 23:32:21','any one care?!'),(8733,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=730f95ea-d250-4fc2-81ed-73834e54e344&&Headline=Thank+you,+Mr+Bush&strParent=strParentID','guest1077','2008-09-14 01:23:50','I absolutely agree with you Mr. Thapar. No other American president would do this for India not even Bill Clinton. George Bush has the guts no matter what other people pr pundits think.'),(8734,'dogtimemedia.com','guest7881','2008-09-14 02:57:16','hi'),(8735,'dogtimemedia.com','guest7881','2008-09-14 02:57:27','hello'),(8736,'dogtimemedia.com','guest7881','2008-09-14 02:57:47','i need some1 who is an expert on dogs'),(8737,'dogtimemedia.com','guest7881','2008-09-14 02:57:50','please help'),(8738,'dogtimemedia.com','guest7881