aeda','guest2398','2008-09-16 06:23:32','assuming these guys only F with those terrorist pieces of shit, I hope you don\\\'t get caught. Make the whole world laugh at these terrorist assholes'),(8893,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=d732f668-83c0-42e0-9366-9189528c90f7&&Headline=Faith+accompli&strParent=strParentID','guest4355','2008-09-16 06:23:44','How sad and yet inevitable that such a lucid, fact based article should generate such rabid comments. We need to reflect on the steps we need to take so as to encourage people to reflect and question and think logicaly in all matters and most particularly in the area most fundamental to our souls - our Faith and How we treat our Neighbour. Surely it should be obvious that God, the creator of the universe, all perfect, all loving is above temporal and temporary notions like nationhood, caste and creed. Whether rich or poor, priveledged or marginalized every human being has the right to seek ways to get closer to his maker, and by so doing he can only become a better person in his individual and public life and therefore a better citizen of his country. A true patriot would welcome such a change.'),(8894,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=WorldSectionPage&id=b5876aa2-dab4-4050-8c3d-a88ce51d5401&&Headline=Hackers+block+Qaeda','guest5993','2008-09-16 06:33:51','r'),(8895,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=WorldSectionPage&id=b5876aa2-dab4-4050-8c3d-a88ce51d5401&&Headline=Hackers+block+Qaeda','guest5993','2008-09-16 06:36:15','r'),(8896,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=WorldSectionPage&id=b5876aa2-dab4-4050-8c3d-a88ce51d5401&&Headline=Hackers+block+Qaeda','guest5993','2008-09-16 06:38:00','I owned a small web hosting company and these MF\\\'ers hacked my site.  Were back but I would love for you guys to keep on hacking these murderers.  Just like we gave them a thousand times the deaths at the world trade center, shut down all their sites.  If Allah agrees with these terrorists then allah is a fraud.  GO USA - Now don\\\'t be jealous!'),(8897,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=WorldSectionPage&id=b5876aa2-dab4-4050-8c3d-a88ce51d5401&&Headline=Hackers+block+Qaeda','guest5993','2008-09-16 06:40:48','I owned a small web hosting company and these MF\\\'ers hacked my site.  Were back but I would love for you guys to keep on hacking these murderers.  Just like we gave them a thousand times the deaths at the world trade center, shut down all their sites.  If Allah agrees with these terrorists then allah is a fraud.  GO USA - Now don\\\'t be jealous!'),(8898,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=WorldSectionPage&id=b5876aa2-dab4-4050-8c3d-a88ce51d5401&&Headline=Hackers+block+Qaeda','guest8423','2008-09-16 06:44:47','I love the new trend of the anonymous taking on greater causes than just chaos or financial gain. Taking on Al Qaeda, the fake-religion of Scientology, dictatorship governments, what\\\'s next?  I hope the US government can recruit some of these guys to take on the cyber-fight full time.'),(8899,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=WorldSectionPage&id=b5876aa2-dab4-4050-8c3d-a88ce51d5401&&Headline=Hackers+block+Qaeda','guest9205','2008-09-16 06:50:33','hahahaa..IntelCenter = A Mossad operation that specializes in disinfo'),(8900,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=d732f668-83c0-42e0-9366-9189528c90f7&&Headline=Faith+accompli&strParent=strParentID','guest7245','2008-09-16 07:03:57','Are these guys journalists? Such one sided artical without any facts to support them. Such sweeping statments and generalizations. I am a Hindu and have to problem admiting that Hinduism is not perfect. But tell me one religion that is. A good article would compare apples to apples. He is not even close. This is like comparing apples to toaster oven. Hinduism is the only religion where you can openly critisize and debate the flaws. Can you do it so openly in other religion. Don\\\'t think so.'),(8901,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=WorldSectionPage&id=b5876aa2-dab4-4050-8c3d-a88ce51d5401&&Headline=Hackers+block+Qaeda','guest4213','2008-09-16 07:07:40','I wonder what the Mossad, an agent of a foreign government didnt want you to hear?   Sure osama and his minions are trash, and so are the israelis.     I can do without your censorship... I can make up my own mind thank you'),(8902,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=WorldSectionPage&id=b5876aa2-dab4-4050-8c3d-a88ce51d5401&&Headline=Hackers+block+Qaeda','guest9205','2008-09-16 07:15:40','You don\\\'t get it guest4213, IntelCenter are the ones who \\\"release\\\" the fake Al-Queda tapes.  On 9/11/08 they were unable to do so for some reason, therefore stating hackers had blocked them from doing so.'),(8903,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=WorldSectionPage&id=b5876aa2-dab4-4050-8c3d-a88ce51d5401&&Headline=Hackers+block+Qaeda','guest553','2008-09-16 07:17:34','freaking awesome, whoever you guys are, keep up the good work fighting those who kill innocent people!'),(8904,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=WorldSectionPage&id=b5876aa2-dab4-4050-8c3d-a88ce51d5401&&Headline=Hackers+block+Qaeda','guest553','2008-09-16 07:20:10','thank you from all of america for persevering in this \\\"deviant\\\" behavior (hacking) to the benefit of freedom everwhere! what a sweet twist of events--what could previously land you in jail is helping keep not only the jail but the country which houses it in existence!'),(8905,'dogtimemedia.com','tdogg','2008-09-16 07:24:10','hi i had to put my dog to sleep july23 2008. she was only 6 yrs.old all of a sudden she couldn\\\'t see walk eat ect. she was full of cancer. my fiance and i are empty inside. i want to surprise him and i also want us to be happy again i am looking for a free puppy (bullmastiff,weimarimers,english bulldog,a puppy that will grow to be an average size dog. my fiance and i can afford to have a dog i just want to surprise my fiance with a puppy and i don\\\'t have the money right now to buy one. and if someone were to give us a puppy more importantly than money we can give the puppy all the love in the world because i am home all day and we have a 3,444 sq.ft fenced in beuatiful yard. so if there is anyone who needs a loving home for there puppy and wants to make a family a family again please let me know asap thank you tia'),(8906,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=d732f668-83c0-42e0-9366-9189528c90f7&&Headline=Faith+accompli&strParent=strParentID','guest9852','2008-09-16 07:46:33','In the beginning I found this article offensive, but then towards the end I started feeling pity for the person who wrote it and few others who might think it to be true. It is obviously logically flawed and makes outrageous claims and assumptions. I have personally been approached by people trying to convert me and sell their religion and the author sounds like one of them in many places. In other places the author sounds like the person who bought the new religion. To the author: Stop the bias, stop the hate, think rationally and you will know what is right.'),(8907,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=d732f668-83c0-42e0-9366-9189528c90f7&&Headline=Faith+accompli&strParent=strParentID','guest9852','2008-09-16 07:51:28','other guests - 2849 and 7565, what are your views on this article??'),(8908,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=d732f668-83c0-42e0-9366-9189528c90f7&&Headline=Faith+accompli&strParent=strParentID','guest7565','2008-09-16 07:52:47','I dont agree to the second dimension of the political act'),(8909,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=d732f668-83c0-42e0-9366-9189528c90f7&&Headline=Faith+accompli&strParent=strParentID','guest9852','2008-09-16 07:53:25','What exactly, do you actually \r\nagree with parts of this article??'),(8910,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=d732f668-83c0-42e0-9366-9189528c90f7&&Headline=Faith+accompli&strParent=strParentID','guest7565','2008-09-16 07:53:58','Conversion is a peronal affair'),(8911,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=d732f668-83c0-42e0-9366-9189528c90f7&&Headline=Faith+accompli&strParent=strParentID','guest9852','2008-09-16 07:54:09','absolutely'),(8912,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=d732f668-83c0-42e0-9366-9189528c90f7&&Headline=Faith+accompli&strParent=strParentID','guest7565','2008-09-16 07:54:21','the dalits are being mistrated'),(8913,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=d732f668-83c0-42e0-9366-9189528c90f7&&Headline=Faith+accompli&strParent=strParentID','guest7565','2008-09-16 07:54:32','and if they start seeing hope somewhere else'),(8914,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=d732f668-83c0-42e0-9366-9189528c90f7&&Headline=Faith+accompli&strParent=strParentID','guest7565','2008-09-16 07:54:37','they would go for it'),(8915,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=d732f668-83c0-42e0-9366-9189528c90f7&&Headline=Faith+accompli&strParent=strParentID','guest7565','2008-09-16 07:55:02','short term gains can force people to take certain actions, like changing their religion'),(8916,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=d732f668-83c0-42e0-9366-9189528c90f7&&Headline=Faith+accompli&strParent=strParentID','guest7565','2008-09-16 07:55:15','but its ahrd to change some one\\\'s beleif'),(8917,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=d732f668-83c0-42e0-9366-9189528c90f7&&Headline=Faith+accompli&strParent=strParentID','guest9852','2008-09-16 07:55:40','I think in India a lot of sections are mistreated, not necessarily dalits alone. In Maharashtra, north-Indian non-Dalits have been mistreated, but then they have been loved too. That has nothing to do with religion. That is more economic, than anything.'),(8918,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=d732f668-83c0-42e0-9366-9189528c90f7&&Headline=Faith+accompli&strParent=strParentID','guest7565','2008-09-16 07:56:12','I agree, it is ecomonic'),(8919,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=d732f668-83c0-42e0-9366-9189528c90f7&&Headline=Faith+accompli&strParent=strParentID','guest9852','2008-09-16 07:56:20','what about this statement - \\\"the Hindus do not seem to have a moral order\\\" - where on earth did the author come up with that - that is blatantly inaccurate'),(8920,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=d732f668-83c0-42e0-9366-9189528c90f7&&Headline=Faith+accompli&strParent=strParentID','guest7565','2008-09-16 07:56:30','and some of the people convert to a different religion for economic gains'),(8921,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=d732f668-83c0-42e0-9366-9189528c90f7&&Headline=Faith+accompli&strParent=strParentID','guest9852','2008-09-16 07:56:59','Exactly, there is a video on youtube about these conversions, do look it up - It is very enlightening'),(8922,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=d732f668-83c0-42e0-9366-9189528c90f7&&Headline=Faith+accompli&strParent=strParentID','guest7565','2008-09-16 07:57:21','the author says that \\\"in the light of jesus story, hindus dont have a moral order....\\\"'),(8923,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=d732f668-83c0-42e0-9366-9189528c90f7&&Headline=Faith+accompli&strParent=strParentID','guest7565','2008-09-16 07:57:45','this is just showing hope to poor people'),(8924,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=d732f668-83c0-42e0-9366-9189528c90f7&&Headline=Faith+accompli&strParent=strParentID','guest7565','2008-09-16 07:57:55','and then having them change into a different religion'),(8925,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=d732f668-83c0-42e0-9366-9189528c90f7&&Headline=Faith+accompli&strParent=strParentID','guest9852','2008-09-16 07:58:01','I don\\\'t remember what I searched\r\n for, but maybe Indian conversions'),(8926,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=d732f668-83c0-42e0-9366-9189528c90f7&&Headline=Faith+accompli&strParent=strParentID','guest7565','2008-09-16 07:58:17','thanks, i will look it up'),(8927,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=d732f668-83c0-42e0-9366-9189528c90f7&&Headline=Faith+accompli&strParent=strParentID','guest9852','2008-09-16 07:58:31','It doesn\\\'t matter the context of the interpretation of that statement. The statement in itself is absolutely false, thereby being context-free.'),(8928,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=d732f668-83c0-42e0-9366-9189528c90f7&&Headline=Faith+accompli&strParent=strParentID','guest9852','2008-09-16 07:58:55','But I do see how you are trying to highlight the possible interpretation'),(8929,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=d732f668-83c0-42e0-9366-9189528c90f7&&Headline=Faith+accompli&strParent=strParentID','guest7565','2008-09-16 07:59:42','the statement is false, anyone making the broad claims does not know what thy are talking about'),(8930,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=d732f668-83c0-42e0-9366-9189528c90f7&&Headline=Faith+accompli&strParent=strParentID','guest7565','2008-09-16 08:00:44','its an interesting article, does make one think about what\\\'s going on there'),(8931,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=d732f668-83c0-42e0-9366-9189528c90f7&&Headline=Faith+accompli&strParent=strParentID','guest7565','2008-09-16 08:00:58','and how our politicians are handling the situation'),(8932,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=d732f668-83c0-42e0-9366-9189528c90f7&&Headline=Faith+accompli&strParent=strParentID','guest9852','2008-09-16 08:01:11','Absolutely ... the author has so much hate in them and then they talk about a loving god'),(8933,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=d732f668-83c0-42e0-9366-9189528c90f7&&Headline=Faith+accompli&strParent=strParentID','guest9852','2008-09-16 08:01:31','The politicians are gundas turned businessmen, it doesn\\\'t matter to them'),(8934,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=d732f668-83c0-42e0-9366-9189528c90f7&&Headline=Faith+accompli&strParent=strParentID','guest9852','2008-09-16 08:01:57','^correction - \r\nthem should be him/her'),(8935,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=d732f668-83c0-42e0-9366-9189528c90f7&&Headline=Faith+accompli&strParent=strParentID','guest7565','2008-09-16 08:03:26','the author seems to be using statistics'),(8936,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=d732f668-83c0-42e0-9366-9189528c90f7&&Headline=Faith+accompli&strParent=strParentID','guest7565','2008-09-16 08:03:51','like where is the christian spending happening etc'),(8937,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=d732f668-83c0-42e0-9366-9189528c90f7&&Headline=Faith+accompli&strParent=strParentID','guest7565','2008-09-16 08:04:02','but an not sure that holds merit'),(8938,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=d732f668-83c0-42e0-9366-9189528c90f7&&Headline=Faith+accompli&strParent=strParentID','guest9852','2008-09-16 08:04:18','While, I have not researched the stats, the implication is logically \r\nflawed.'),(8939,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=d732f668-83c0-42e0-9366-9189528c90f7&&Headline=Faith+accompli&strParent=strParentID','guest7565','2008-09-16 08:04:38','i agree, the implication is flawed'),(8940,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=d732f668-83c0-42e0-9366-9189528c90f7&&Headline=Faith+accompli&strParent=strParentID','guest7565','2008-09-16 08:05:22','the author should do some more research before taking sides'),(8941,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=d732f668-83c0-42e0-9366-9189528c90f7&&Headline=Faith+accompli&strParent=strParentID','guest7565','2008-09-16 08:05:40','the journalists job is to report, and try to be unbiased in their report'),(8942,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=d732f668-83c0-42e0-9366-9189528c90f7&&Headline=Faith+accompli&strParent=strParentID','guest9852','2008-09-16 08:05:51','What exactly are these \\\"establishment costs\\\". The references could have been better stated for sure. Those statements hold no meaning. I wish I could write papers like these :)'),(8943,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=d732f668-83c0-42e0-9366-9189528c90f7&&Headline=Faith+accompli&strParent=strParentID','guest7565','2008-09-16 08:05:53','not to take sides, and bash religions/communities'),(8944,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=d732f668-83c0-42e0-9366-9189528c90f7&&Headline=Faith+accompli&strParent=strParentID','guest7565','2008-09-16 08:06:32','the article seems to be written in a hurry'),(8945,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=d732f668-83c0-42e0-9366-9189528c90f7&&Headline=Faith+accompli&strParent=strParentID','guest9852','2008-09-16 08:07:34','The person doesn\\\'t seem like a journalist, it\\\'s just a human being with strong views and some hate on a particular subject. The media likes such articles because it gives them publicity, it results in the community that was attacked (in this case, Hindus) \r\nto reciprocate in kind.'),(8946,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=d732f668-83c0-42e0-9366-9189528c90f7&&Headline=Faith+accompli&strParent=strParentID','guest9852','2008-09-