e advent of Islam and islamic invaders came to build masjid on hindu temples. Do they think that rage is only right of Muslims. Did they ever considered this point? It is high time that media should ask a few uncomfortable questions to these guys rather than just playing in the hands of political parties that they were enraged because of Babri masjid but did'),(9610,'dogtimemedia.com','guest4038','2008-09-24 13:46:54','Hey Room'),(9611,'dogtimemedia.com','guest4038','2008-09-24 13:47:09','my name is Kelly'),(9612,'dogtimemedia.com','guest2128','2008-09-24 14:56:18','hi'),(9613,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=3b05afa9-d0ef-426d-9fbb-237fc172456e&&Headline=Post+offices+to+sport+new+logo&strParent=strParentID','guest8786','2008-09-24 15:18:02','Will the New Logo bring in Change in Attitude? only then it can be vibrant'),(9614,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=3b05afa9-d0ef-426d-9fbb-237fc172456e&&Headline=Post+offices+to+sport+new+logo&strParent=strParentID','guest8786','2008-09-24 15:19:15','In India Post Ek ka Naam Raja hai and other one is from Rajgharana'),(9615,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=3b05afa9-d0ef-426d-9fbb-237fc172456e&&Headline=Post+offices+to+sport+new+logo&strParent=strParentID','guest8786','2008-09-24 15:19:39','They say Jiska Raja Bepari'),(9616,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=3b05afa9-d0ef-426d-9fbb-237fc172456e&&Headline=Post+offices+to+sport+new+logo&strParent=strParentID','guest8786','2008-09-24 15:19:53','Uski Praja Bhikari'),(9617,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=3b05afa9-d0ef-426d-9fbb-237fc172456e&&Headline=Post+offices+to+sport+new+logo&strParent=strParentID','guest8786','2008-09-24 15:20:56','Lalu could change the Railways got it out of Red....'),(9618,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=3b05afa9-d0ef-426d-9fbb-237fc172456e&&Headline=Post+offices+to+sp