ntent and agri linkage.\r\n\r\nCheers!'),(11188,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=IndiaSectionPage&id=e674225b-0770-410b-b388-29ec97e4bb55&&Headline=Urban+India+gets+going+on+probiotic+products','guest9999','2008-10-14 05:10:04','where are probiotic milk/curds/cheese availbale'),(11189,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=IndiaSectionPage&id=e674225b-0770-410b-b388-29ec97e4bb55&&Headline=Urban+India+gets+going+on+probiotic+products','guest9999','2008-10-14 05:12:15','plz let me knw about probiotic products'),(11190,'dogtimemedia.com','guest107','2008-10-14 05:14:10','hi'),(11191,'dogtimemedia.com','guest107','2008-10-14 05:15:27','i love pets'),(11192,'dogtimemedia.com','guest5380','2008-10-14 09:31:38','hello everyone'),(11193,'dogtimemedia.com','guest5380','2008-10-14 09:31:53','is anyone still here'),(11194,'dogtimemedia.com','guest5380','2008-10-14 09:32:14','guess not oh well'),(11195,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=6481ec95-96af-45d0-b595-1cfd567a0474&&Headline=Rooing+for+EMrotis/EM','guest2027','2008-10-14 09:57:57','Ms. Duggal could have done much better. I am a South Indian (nevertheless an Indian) and many a daily meal of mine is devoid of ANY bread. I am sure this would stand for many East Indians too, viz., Bengalis, Oriyas etc. Hence, Ms. Duggal stands corrected. She could have commenced her article better by stating \\\" Can you imagine a typical North Indian meal without bread? \\\"'),(11196,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=6481ec95-96af-45d0-b595-1cfd567a0474&&Headline=Rooing+for+EMrotis/EM','guest2027','2008-10-14 09:59:21','Unless , of course, Ms. Duggal considers our cuisine as a non- Indian one !'),(11197,'dogtimemedia.com','guest8306','2008-10-14 11:05:58','were do u live?'),(11198,'dogtimemedia.com','guest457','2008-10-14 11:32:48','hi anybody got a spitz'),(11199,'dogtimemedia.com','guest8738','2008-10-14 13:01:20','scoop?'),(112