.'),(11745,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=HomePage&id=e918035f-6cf3-44e5-9695-23d44f4f1bd8&MatchID1=4814&TeamID1=6&TeamID2=1&MatchType1=1&SeriesID1=1212&PrimaryID=4814&Headline=The+next+Prime+Minister?','guest452','2008-10-17 21:25:00','But what the writer actually missed was that pandit Nehru was a real leader in the true sense .he lead the nation from the front.He motivated people,made them emotional ,made them feel real ,made them feel that he was there very own .He was not only a part of the public but was a real public.'),(11746,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=HomePage&id=e918035f-6cf3-44e5-9695-23d44f4f1bd8&MatchID1=4814&TeamID1=6&TeamID2=1&MatchType1=1&SeriesID1=1212&PrimaryID=4814&Headline=The+next+Prime+Minister?','guest452','2008-10-17 21:27:40','The present prime minister stay completely alienated.he is completely bureucratic and gives an impression that he has just been thrust there by virtue of his being an achiever and he owns nothing to the public and the nation as long as his mentor madam Gandhi is out there to shield him for ever.'),(11747,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=HomePage&id=e918035f-6cf3-44e5-9695-23d44f4f1bd8&MatchID1=4814&TeamID1=6&TeamID2=1&MatchType1=1&SeriesID1=1212&PrimaryID=4814&Headline=The+next+Prime+Minister?','guest452','2008-10-17 21:29:20','Just step out of Delhi and speak to people .They will tell you that Mr. Singh has done absolutely nothing for the people.\\\"How can he do anything when he can\\\'t even speak to the people,\\\"That is the people\\\'s  version not mine.'),(11748,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=HomePage&id=e918035f-6cf3-44e5-9695-23d44f4f1bd8&MatchID1=4814&TeamID1=6&TeamID2=1&MatchType1=1&SeriesID1=1212&PrimaryID=4814&Headline=The+next+Prime+Minister?','hemanth.itsme','2008-10-17 21:31:11','Hi, everyone. I really appreciate ur participation on such an issue,'),(11749,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=HomePage&id=e918035f-6cf3-44e5-9695-23d44f4f1bd8&MatchID1=4814&TeamID1=6&TeamID2=1&MatchType1=1&SeriesID1=1212&PrimaryID=4814&Headline=The+next+Prime+Minister?','guest452','2008-10-17 21:32:01','Mahanti'),(11750,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=HomePage&id=e918035f-6cf3-44e5-9695-23d44f4f1bd8&MatchID1=4814&TeamID1=6&TeamID2=1&MatchType1=1&SeriesID1=1212&PrimaryID=4814&Headline=The+next+Prime+Minister?','hemanth.itsme','2008-10-17 21:39:35','howcome u people r turning so dramatic, which all our corrupted ministers do. I don\\\'t say that Mr.Manmohan is a good leader, however he is a better one. I don\\\'t think so, there is necessity for every leaders to be a good actor, what the general public accepts(good orator, commander, a good political base so on....). A good leader is a one who never try to cheat is citizens by emotions, drama, and all those cinema stuffs. He is what he is. Now we are in stage where, its our duty to bring up India, not rely on prime ministers or someone. So, friends its our nation, its our sole responsibility to build it.'),(11751,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=HomePage&id=e918035f-6cf3-44e5-9695-23d44f4f1bd8&MatchID1=4814&TeamID1=6&TeamID2=1&MatchType1=1&SeriesID1=1212&PrimaryID=4814&Headline=The+next+Prime+Minister?','hemanth.itsme','2008-10-17 21:39:56','Jai Hind.'),(11752,'dogtimemedia.com','guest4610','2008-10-17 22:02:34','hello'),(11753,'dogtimemedia.com','guest7035','2008-10-17 22:23:51','hello'),(11754,'dogtimemedia.com','guest7035','2008-10-17 22:25:49','my rottie is very ill her face is so swollen that her eyes are puffy and she looks like a pit bull. her breathing is at a panting state, does anyone here ever experience this roblem with their rotties?'),(11755,'dogtimemedia.com','guest9104','2008-10-17 23:01:04','what is the best food to feed dogs?'),(11756,'dogtimemedia.com','guest9104','2008-10-17 23:02:09','i have an american pitbull terrier and he is still a puppy but what is the best puppy food to get for him?'),(11757,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?id=a45dfb2e-f375-4a68-84eb-ec2cccbad0c4','guest2371','2008-10-18 00:22:18','how \r\nis the condition now, when will he speak'),(11758,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?id=a45dfb2e-f375-4a68-84eb-ec2cccbad0c4','guest2371','2008-10-18 00:23:33','the reports said that only a miracle can save him, has the miracle ha\r\nppened'),(11759,'dogtimemedia.com','guest7035','2008-10-18 00:34:14','nutro'),(11760,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=&id=a358f783-c6f4-4bc6-a546-9302dc2f4176&MatchID1=4814&TeamID1=6&TeamID2=1&MatchType1=1&SeriesID1=1212&PrimaryID=4814&Headline=Lankan+envoy+summoned','guest208','2008-10-18 01:52:37','Sri Lanka is a sovereign democratic country. Tamil Tigers are ruthless murderers who want to set up a racist regime by force'),(11761,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/FullcoverageStoryPage.aspx?id=ae5697c0-89ff-4aa8-b816-85f269492a65Tata-Singurrow_Special&MatchID1=4814&TeamID1=6&TeamID2=1&MatchType1=1&SeriesID1=1212&PrimaryID=4814&Headline=Apologise+or+face+legal+action','guest5924','2008-10-18 03:53:34','Ratan Tata\\\'s has hit the core of  the West Bengal\\\'s problem, spot on. The people have to choose between a road towards industrialisation and modernisation, led by the current CM, or towards more backwardness and anarchy led by politicians like Mamata Banerjee. I am not surprised when Forward Block objects to Tata\\\'s assessment of Bengal\\\'s situation. These leaders (Prakash Karat type) put their own or their party\\\'s own interest before the country\\\'s or people\\\'s interest. West Bengal in particular, and India in general will speed up towards liberty from poverty when people of the country gains the ability to identify these types of politicians and quickly throw them into garbage can. I think these days are not very far off.'),(11762,'dogtimemedia.com','guest9297','20