ant love one country where you live you can never love any country. You cant love and respect others if you cant love and respe'),(13839,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=HomePage&id=ba55b566-4f3d-4587-9d3b-54559e6f694d&&Headline=Obama+and+the+world','guest2381','2008-10-25 12:42:31','THANKS, BUT NO THANKS. We don\\\'t need you/Non-Americans voting in Americas elections like you don\\\'t need Pakistanis/Chinese/Bangladeshis voting in YOUR elections. Obviously most people in the media business are liberal leaning as you are taught in journalism to question authority and stand up for the little guy. Sadly, the most essential element of STANDING FOR WHAT IS RIGHT is missing among current day journalists. So what I say is this: STANDING FOR WHAT IS RIGHT FOR THE LITTLE GUY OR THE BIG GUY. Blindly standing up to authority rather that STANDING UP FOR THE TRUTH is WRONG in itself. I also hear a lot about Global Citizen. Well, we have example of global citizen... PALISTINE. See how its working for them. People those who believe they are not a citizen of A country but the citizen of the world is equivalent of saying I don\\\'t have one mother but I have multiple mothers. If you cant love one country where you live you can never love any country. You cant love and respect others if you cant love and respe'),(13840,'dogtimemedia.com','guest8022','2008-10-25 12:43:11','are you in the u.s.?'),(13841,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=HomePage&id=ba55b566-4f3d-4587-9d3b-54559e6f694d&&Headline=Obama+and+the+world','guest2381','2008-10-25 12:43:12','THANKS, BUT NO THANKS. We don\\\'t need you/Non-Americans voting in Americas elections like you don\\\'t need Pakistanis/Chinese/Bangladeshis voting in YOUR elections. Obviously most people in the media business are liberal leaning as you are taught in journalism to question authority and stand up for the little guy. Sadly, the most essential element of STANDING FOR WHAT IS RIGHT is missing among current day journalists.'),(13842,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=HomePage&id=ba55b566-4f3d-4587-9d3b-54559e6f694d&&Headline=Obama+and+the+world','guest2381','2008-10-25 12:43:19','So what I say is this: STANDING FOR WHAT IS RIGHT FOR THE LITTLE GUY OR THE BIG GUY. Blindly standing up to authority rather that STANDING UP FOR THE TRUTH is WRONG in itself. I also hear a lot about Global Citizen. Well, we have example of global citizen... PALISTINE.'),(13843,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=HomePage&id=ba55b566-4f3d-4587-9d3b-54559e6f694d&&Headline=Obama+and+the+world','guest2381','2008-10-25 12:43:26','See how its working for them. People those who believe they are not a citizen of A country but the citizen of the world is equivalent of saying I don\\\'t have one mother but I have multiple mothers. If you cant love one country where you live you can never love any country. You cant love and respect others if you cant love and respect yourself.'),(13844,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=HomePage&id=ba55b566-4f3d-4587-9d3b-54559e6f694d&&Headline=Obama+and+the+world','guest2381','2008-10-25 12:43:34','On Americas problems, yes we have a lot of problems, but we are not nieve to think that electing one person will get rid of all our problems. \nIts just silly to think that way. We as Americans know that we have what it takes to solve whatever problems we are faced with and also along the way reduce some of the worlds problems.'),(13845,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=HomePage&id=ba55b566-4f3d-4587-9d3b-54559e6f694d&&Headline=Obama+and+the+world','guest2381','2008-10-25 12:43:41','Your readers are better served when you espouse your liberal views to liberate your own country from the problems it faces. eg. Discrimination because of castism. Abuse and Exploitation of lower casts by upper casts. Quotas for lower casts when a person of upper cast is better qualified.'),(13846,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=HomePage&id=ba55b566-4f3d-4587-9d3b-54559e6f694d&&Headline=Obama+and+the+world','guest2381','2008-10-25 12:43:47','Both are wrong. Talibanization by some hindu groups. Institutional failures by your judiciary. Should you choose to venture into international affairs, then you should talk about the black on black genocide in Darfur. Muslim on Muslim voilence in Palistine, Iraq, Afganistan.'),(13847,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=HomePage&id=ba55b566-4f3d-4587-9d3b-54559e6f694d&&Headline=Obama+and+the+world','guest2381','2008-10-25 12:43:54','I am perplexed at Indias double standard when on one hand it says Kashmir is Indias Domestic matter on the other hand it is interfearing in Sri Lankas domestic matter.'),(13848,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=HomePage&id=ba55b566-4f3d-4587-9d3b-54559e6f694d&&Headline=Obama+and+the+world','guest2381','2008-10-25 12:44:00','Rather than BS of saying thats our internal affair, you should stand for what is RIGHT rather than hide behind the shield of Internal Affair. Also, if you want to talk about outside affairs, you should talk about dictators and despots around the world like Saudi Ruler, Putin, Hugo Chaves, Fidel Castro, Kim Jong IL, dictator or Iran etc. These are the real enemies of the people.'),(13849,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=HomePage&id=ba55b566-4f3d-4587-9d3b-54559e6f694d&&Headline=Obama+and+the+world','guest2381','2008-10-25 12:44:08','They have taken away and continue to take peoples rights away. There is a saying in New Hampshiere LIVE FREE OR DIE. Thats hove important freedom is for humans to flourish and prosper.'),(13850,'dogtimemedia.com','jamie','2008-10-25 12:45:09','out on trip'),(13851,'dogtimemedia.com','guest8022','2008-10-25 12:46:32','nice'),(13852,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=HomePage&id=ba55b566-4f3d-