You should do introinspect first Mr writer.'),(14032,'dogtimemedia.com','guest4872','2008-10-26 09:18:16','Oh well, thank you for your time. I\\\'ll be sure to come back again.'),(14033,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=HomePage&id=00f5bab6-2968-4a0e-bcaa-03728b7ec240&&Headline=Howling+at+the+moon','guest365','2008-10-26 09:29:46','wow ! Is this guy deluded or what ?'),(14034,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=HomePage&id=760f768a-8aa8-4da5-a5dc-6499cb4a28f9&&Headline=Orange+County','guest5778','2008-10-26 09:37:14','I am not sure what the author is trying to convey. Is he trying to  dismiss the fact that Hinduism is the bedrock of the Indian nation? If he is, then is trying to sow the seeds of separatism in INDIA again. The areas which are peaceful are the ones that are Hindu majority. Indian areas which are minority dominated are always looking for setting themselves as Moslem or Christian areas. Look at Meghalya. India will survive as Hindu nation. Those who cannot accept that fact should go to Pakistan or Bangladesh.'),(14035,'dogtimemedia.com','guest8412','2008-10-26 09:40:22','what is the weirdest things your dog has eaten?'),(14036,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=HomePage&id=00f5bab6-2968-4a0e-bcaa-03728b7ec240&&Headline=Howling+at+the+moon','scruffy08','2008-10-26 09:41:09','Damned if you do; damned if you don\\\'t. The author is a cynic..sounds to me as someone who sees the glass as half-empty. No one denies  there are several societal challenges India faces..instead of highlighting those and suggesting measures to tackle them he is denigrating the stupendous achievement of our scientists..He comes across as arrogant..Sorry...'),(14037,'dogtimemedia.com','guest8412','2008-10-26 09:41:16','my dog has eaten his own poop'),(14038,'dogtimemedia.com','guest9287','2008-10-26 09:51:00','ok...'),(14039,'dogtimemedia.com','DTMCM ML','2008-10-26 09:52:01','DogTime Media focuses on provi