e socio-economic disparity and that matter has been ignored right from the formation of the district. If a soci-economic balance is maintained among the tribes then it will be hard to change or bring their focus on religions. Its time for critics to analyse from a pure angle and not put t any odd reason to justify the incident. Critical incident reporting is an art based on thorough analysis of the matter and puting forth justified solutions.'),(14048,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=HomePage&id=00f5bab6-2968-4a0e-bcaa-03728b7ec240&&Headline=Howling+at+the+moon','guest7450','2008-10-26 10:22:25','But whatever may be, one thing is sure, Sir, if i were in the board of selection of Nobel Lauterate in Literature, bingo, u have it. For, showing our own darker side. But I have only question to put to you? I there weren\\\'t any scientific reason in the renaissance, europe still have being poor, poorer than India. Isn\\\'t the same case applies here? Please reply. Oh or else you have just written such article to garner some free publicity, there is not shame in accepting such facts, women go naked to get some. You have just undressed your own country( if you don\\\'t want to call it motherland or fatherland).'),(14049,'dogtimemedia.com','guest5024','2008-10-26 10:30:36','hey man/lady, i tell you they\\\'ll wear \nyou out'),(14050,'dogtimemedia.com','guest5024','2008-10-26 10:30:52','lol'),(14051,'dogtimemedia.com','guest5981','2008-10-26 10:31:34','Hello dog lovers faith and ms kitty are here'),(14052,'www.zeenews.com','guest2085','2008-10-26 10:31:34','Talking about Bollywood to easo out a bit, everyone asks why doesnt Salman marry anybody . The reason I think is his irrational behaviour everywhere, lot of times. His girls get embarassed and doint want any associations with him.'),(14053,'dogtimemedia.com','guest5981','2008-10-26 10:32:33','anyone feel like having dog chat'),(14054,'dogtimemedia.com','guest5024','2008-10-26 10:33:45','yeah sure