nt to move so bad, but all my family is here so I can\\\'t leave'),(15325,'dogtimemedia.com','guest7722','2008-10-29 09:48:12','but it does get cold. not a lot to hold the heat. i found it is true in the desert. hot in the day, cool at night'),(15326,'dogtimemedia.com','guest8839','2008-10-29 09:48:23','we got lucky and found our female Husky, Lily, at the pound!!'),(15327,'dogtimemedia.com','guest7722','2008-10-29 09:48:48','well i used to live on the east coast. i came from Martha\\\'s Vineyard Island to New Mexico. talk about a change.'),(15328,'dogtimemedia.com','guest7722','2008-10-29 09:49:07','yeah there are a lot of great dogs sitting in the pounds'),(15329,'dogtimemedia.com','guest8839','2008-10-29 09:49:18','wow..that is a change'),(15330,'dogtimemedia.com','guest7722','2008-10-29 09:49:48','it wasn\\\'t my idea to come here, domestic abuse story, but i sure miss the east coast'),(15331,'dogtimemedia.com','guest8839','2008-10-29 09:50:16','well, I found out why she was in the pound...she was there with 2 of her sisters...and the owner brought them there because they weren\\\'t the red/white coat like she wanted....so she dropped them off at the pound!'),(15332,'dogtimemedia.com','guest8839','2008-10-29 09:50:34','it\\\'s disgusting how some people just throw their animals away like that'),(15333,'dogtimemedia.com','guest7722','2008-10-29 09:50:49','oh my god, what a stupid reason to turn pups in. she shouldn\\\'t have dogs'),(15334,'dogtimemedia.com','guest8839','2008-10-29 09:51:07','that\\\'s what I said'),(15335,'dogtimemedia.com','guest7722','2008-10-29 09:51:19','i ran a shelter for years and you really start to hate the public because you see horrible people everyday'),(15336,'dogtimemedia.com','guest8839','2008-10-29 09:51:26','she has a beautiful red/white coat is you ask me...it get ligjhter in the spring/summer...'),(15337,'dogtimemedia.com','guest8839','2008-10-29 09:51:40','yea, I know...I volunteer at one sometimes'),(15338,'dogtimemedia.com',