ine'),(15351,'dogtimemedia.com','guest7722','2008-10-29 09:56:31','and with 7 jacks, it takes time, but so worth it'),(15352,'dogtimemedia.com','guest8839','2008-10-29 09:56:39','I used to live on a farm...and we showed our Horses, cows and goats and we had to shave them, clip them and I loved it all'),(15353,'dogtimemedia.com','guest7722','2008-10-29 09:57:07','that must have been fun.'),(15354,'dogtimemedia.com','guest7722','2008-10-29 09:57:43','i live down the street from  the rodeo grounds and walk there and watch the rodeos and whatever else they have going on. lots of fun'),(15355,'dogtimemedia.com','guest8839','2008-10-29 09:57:52','I loved it...now we only have 2 acres where we are...so we can\\\'t get horses...I love horses so much, and I love riding..'),(15356,'dogtimemedia.com','guest8839','2008-10-29 09:58:20','I used to barrel race with one of our horses, and I also taught her to jump'),(15357,'dogtimemedia.com','guest7722','2008-10-29 09:58:38','i used to ride, and always wanted a horse, but i don\\\'t know much about them so it wouldn\\\'t be fair to get one and not know how to care for it.'),(15358,'dogtimemedia.com','guest7722','2008-10-29 09:58:48','i love watching the barrel races.'),(15359,'dogtimemedia.com','guest7722','2008-10-29 09:59:17','plus i have enough to do keeping up with my dogs and kennel work.'),(15360,'dogtimemedia.com','guest8839','2008-10-29 09:59:22','yeah they are fun'),(15361,'dogtimemedia.com','guest8839','2008-10-29 09:59:32','yea...it sounds like you got your hands full'),(15362,'dogtimemedia.com','guest7722','2008-10-29 09:59:49','the combination of man and horse working together is really amazing'),(15363,'dogtimemedia.com','guest8839','2008-10-29 10:00:47','it sure is...my husband brought me riding for my birthday a couple weeks ago...and I loved it..I miss riding everyday'),(15364,'dogtimemedia.com','guest7722','2008-10-29 10:00:49','well my dogs keep me active and at my age,anything that keeps you moving is good thing