g....kinder to the pup'),(15396,'dogtimemedia.com','guest7722','2008-10-29 10:08:16','i recently had to put a puppy down that i bred due to mega esophogus'),(15397,'dogtimemedia.com','guest7722','2008-10-29 10:08:42','my moto as a breeder is Quality of life over Quantity of life'),(15398,'dogtimemedia.com','guest3638','2008-10-29 10:08:42','Ah I see... the pup\\\'s palat is also not right.'),(15399,'dogtimemedia.com','guest4218','2008-10-29 10:08:46','its hard to make a decision to put a puppy down but it seems like if he is going to suffer and not get well its best for him.'),(15400,'dogtimemedia.com','guest3638','2008-10-29 10:09:15','Thank you so much.  This makes me feel better about putting him to sleep.'),(15401,'dogtimemedia.com','guest4218','2008-10-29 10:09:18','It seems like the mother wasn\\\'t feeding this pup for a reason.'),(15402,'dogtimemedia.com','guest7722','2008-10-29 10:09:25','its very hard to make that decision but you have to do what is best for the dog not you'),(15403,'dogtimemedia.com','guest4218','2008-10-29 10:09:32','poor guy'),(15404,'dogtimemedia.com','guest7722','2008-10-29 10:09:39','with a cleft palette it couldn\\\'t nurse correctly'),(15405,'dogtimemedia.com','guest8839','2008-10-29 10:09:42','yea...I wouldn\\\'t want to let an animal suffer...I had to put a horse down after we rescued her...she had old fractures to her leg...it was terrible'),(15406,'dogtimemedia.com','guest3638','2008-10-29 10:09:46','I worked in a hospital for 20 years, and letting go of this puppy is the hardest decision I have ever made.'),(15407,'dogtimemedia.com','guest4218','2008-10-29 10:10:27','I\\\'m sure the vet that you take this puppy to would tell you that putting it down would be the best thing for it.'),(15408,'dogtimemedia.com','guest7722','2008-10-29 10:10:42','i was an emergency/critical care vet tech for 16 years and it\\\'s hard, very hard to be the one to make the decision, but do it with love for the puppy'),(15409,'dogtimemedia.com','guest