ry for whaat your going through. :9'),(15421,'dogtimemedia.com','guest7722','2008-10-29 10:13:14','sorry spelled that incorrectly'),(15422,'dogtimemedia.com','guest4218','2008-10-29 10:13:19','thats tough.'),(15423,'dogtimemedia.com','guest7722','2008-10-29 10:14:05','think of it this way, better to put the puppy down humanely than if it had stayed with mom it might have lingered a while and died a terrible death.'),(15424,'dogtimemedia.com','guest8839','2008-10-29 10:14:07','good luck with everything 3638...you will make the right choice'),(15425,'dogtimemedia.com','guest3638','2008-10-29 10:14:44','Thanks again... I have to go for now... Just to let you know... I am on my second cat with no eyes, and they are the mose precious and wonderful pets! I have also made the arrangements for my entire estate to go to animal rescue and placement when I am gone.  I did not get my first pet until I was 43.... and it changed my life to say the least.  I am going to see the Vet this afternoon and say goodbye to Joey'),(15426,'dogtimemedia.com','guest8839','2008-10-29 10:15:07','alright...I have to go...my boys are up from their naps'),(15427,'dogtimemedia.com','guest7722','2008-10-29 10:15:16','i\\\'m sure you will make the right choice, well i have to go start my playtime with the dogs, walks, etc. and clean kennels'),(15428,'dogtimemedia.com','guest8839','2008-10-29 10:15:24','good luck again with your Chi...and good bye everyone it was nice talking to you all'),(15429,'dogtimemedia.com','guest7722','2008-10-29 10:15:36','bye everyone'),(15430,'dogtimemedia.com','dogtimemedia','2008-10-29 10:18:33','bye 7722'),(15431,'dogtimemedia.com','dogtimemedia','2008-10-29 10:18:42','MODERATOR ALERT:'),(15432,'dogtimemedia.com','dogtimemedia','2008-10-29 10:18:59','DogTime Media focuses on providing the best chat experience with other pet enthusiasts for PetChat users. We have moderators logged in to ensure we can create that environment for you. Users who are saying offensive words/to