 other places in parts of India are clear shining examples of that. The so-called uppercaste do not want these masses to be educated or uplifted from their pathetic condition or the loose there hegemony. It\\\'s as simple as that. This BJP/VHP/BjDal/RSS movements is a total conspiracy of the elite uppercastes to retain the age old feudal system. Of course not all people of upper caste may fall in that..'),(24971,'dogtimemedia.com','guest7638','2008-11-12 10:12:39','hi everybody'),(24972,'dogtimemedia.com','guest5272','2008-11-12 10:15:43','hiyah every every body'),(24973,'dogtimemedia.com','guest5272','2008-11-12 10:15:49','im at a swchool'),(24974,'dogtimemedia.com','guest5272','2008-11-12 10:15:55','im at school'),(24975,'dogtimemedia.com','guest5272','2008-11-12 10:16:05','in my tech class'),(24976,'dogtimemedia.com','guest5272','2008-11-12 10:16:10','lol'),(24977,'dogtimemedia.com','guest5272','2008-11-12 10:16:32','dude!!!!!!!!!!!!'),(24978,'dogtimemedia.com','guest5272','2008-11-12 10:16:37','anybody there'),(24979,'dogtimemedia.com','guest7838','2008-11-12 10:23:17','Any dog breeders on here today?'),(24980,'dogtimemedia.com','todddog1','2008-11-12 10:24:16','Any particular breed?'),(24981,'dogtimemedia.com','guest7838','2008-11-12 10:24:32','Doesn\\\'t matter but mine are Olde English Bulldogges'),(24982,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=ViewsSectionPage&id=693b4b7d-8d39-4edb-bf7c-d7ba749e4ab3&MatchID1=4852&TeamID1=7&TeamID2=4&MatchType1=2&SeriesID1=1222&PrimaryID=4852&Headline=Dialling+dilemma','guest1032','2008-11-12 10:25:55','It seems Mr. Obama has not called up the world leaders but world leaders have called up Mr. Obama congratulating him for his newly won prize, the office.    It might have been considered polite for Dr. Manmohan singh to congratulate Mr. Obama.'),(24983,'dogtimemedia.com','guest8555','2008-11-12 10:26:58','anybody know anything about pure bred husky puppies?'),(24984,'dogtimemedia.com','guest7838','2008-11-12 10:27:42','I have a question for other breeders about dog pregnancy.'),(24985,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=ViewsSectionPage&id=693b4b7d-8d39-4edb-bf7c-d7ba749e4ab3&MatchID1=4852&TeamID1=7&TeamID2=4&MatchType1=2&SeriesID1=1222&PrimaryID=4852&Headline=Dialling+dilemma','guest1032','2008-11-12 10:29:24','Generally, when someone achieves a distinction, by winning a prize or office it is customery for others to call the person to congratulate him.'),(24986,'dogtimemedia.com','todddog1','2008-11-12 10:32:57','hmm I know on Dogtime.com there are local listings,'),(24987,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=ViewsSectionPage&id=693b4b7d-8d39-4edb-bf7c-d7ba749e4ab3&MatchID1=4852&TeamID1=7&TeamID2=4&MatchType1=2&SeriesID1=1222&PrimaryID=4852&Headline=Dialling+dilemma','guest1032','2008-11-12 10:33:05','So, Indian press pundits, instead of taking offence at Mr. Obama not calling India\\\'s Prime Minister, you should ask Dr. Manmohan singh did he call Mr. Obama to congratulate him?'),(24988,'dogtimemedia.com','guest9868','2008-11-12 10:37:48','hello'),(24989,'dogtimemedia.com','guest6677','2008-11-12 10:49:22','Hello, anyone have experience with pugs and why they may suddenly start pooping inside? I recently adopted a 2 yr. old and he wasn\\\'t housetrained. He did very well for 4 weeks, and then started pooping inside. Absolutely nothing changed. Same food. Same people in the house. Same bed and bedding location. Same routine for each day. Help! Now he\\\'s started peeing inside, too.'),(24990,'dogtimemedia.com','coop14','2008-11-12 10:51:16','does he poop when you\\\'re home or only when you\\\'re done?'),(24991,'dogtimemedia.com','coop14','2008-11-12 10:51:26','i meant when you\\\'re gone?'),(24992,'dogtimemedia.com','guest6677','2008-11-12 10:51:40','Both. He even tries to do it in front of me, and of course I take him outside immediately.'),(24993,'dogtimemedia.com','guest6677','2008-11-12 10:52:06','HE will even do it within minutes of pooping outside during a long walk.'),(24994,'dogtimemedia.com','coop14','2008-11-12 10:54:02','wow this is a difficult one...'),(24995,'dogtimemedia.com','coop14','2008-11-12 10:54:46','you could start crate training him'),(24996,'dogtimemedia.com','guest6677','2008-11-12 10:55:13','He is crate trained. I don\\\'t want to use the crate as punishment, though. I\\\'d rather he is happy in his crate.'),(24997,'dogtimemedia.com','guest6677','2008-11-12 10:55:47','I have started, again, making him stay in his crate during the hours I am at work. Before, he had run of a small room that his crate is in.'),(24998,'dogtimemedia.com','coop14','2008-11-12 10:56:08','yes that\\\'s true, you don\\\'t want to associate the crate with punishment.  you are giving him treats when he does  his business outside?'),(24999,'dogtimemedia.com','guest6677','2008-11-12 10:57:02','I don\\\'t give him treats, but lots of praise and pets, which is how we started  when I first got him. It\\\'s far too easy for pugs to get fat, so I limit treats to really difficult training. He responds very well to praise.'),(25000,'dogtimemedia.com','coop14','2008-11-12 10:57:47','that\\\'s good.  how about his feeding schedule - do you feed him at the same time everyday, take him out at the same time everyday?'),(25001,'dogtimemedia.com','guest6677','2008-11-12 10:58:55','Yes, for meals. 7am breakfast, 6pm dinner. Rarely varies. Weekends vary for daytime activity, but the morning and night time walks don\\\'t vary any day.'),(25002,'dogtimemedia.com','coop14','2008-11-12 11:01:27','have you talked to your vet about the problem?'),(25003,'dogtimemedia.com','coop14','2008-11-12 11:05:08','it could be a behavior thing - maybe he has separation anxiety or some other behavior that he\\\'s trying to make you aware of'),(25004,'dogtimemedia.com','guest3543','2008-11-12 11:08:34','hi'),(25005,'dogtimemedia.com','guest2731','2008-11-12 11:12:04','hi'),(25006,'dogtimemedia.com','guest6677','2008-