for everything.  They think it was a virus or bacterial infection. We had to make her take a pill and now she is hacking too.  Could it ave scrached her throat and then the shaking like she is scared'),(27454,'dogtimemedia.com','Sandi','2008-11-15 18:18:33','I am new here and don\\\'t know how this works'),(27455,'dogtimemedia.com','guest195','2008-11-15 18:18:35','Might be anxiety and since it\\\'s been sick, sounds like it.  Dogs are very in tune and senses very keen, so it\\\'s even more sensitive now that it\\\'s sick and probably didn\\\'t enjoy the medicine.  Wrap them in a blanket to eliminate the cold option and ask vet if it doesn\\\'t seem to be feeling better tomorrow or next day.'),(27456,'dogtimemedia.com','Sandi','2008-11-15 18:19:20','Yes if she is still having the hacking and the shaking I plan on taking her to the vet monday'),(27457,'dogtimemedia.com','Sandi','2008-11-15 18:19:50','she spent last Sunday nite at the emergency clinic and all day at the vet'),(27458,'dogtimemedia.com','guest195','2008-11-15 18:19:54','Hopefully, it\\\'s not a reaction to the medicine.  Did the hacking and shaking start after it took the pill?'),(27459,'dogtimemedia.com','Sandi','2008-11-15 18:20:25','The hacking started after we had to force her to take the pill she spits them out with food'),(27460,'dogtimemedia.com','Sandi','2008-11-15 18:20:52','So was thinking she maybe scratched her throat'),(27461,'dogtimemedia.com','guest195','2008-11-15 18:21:25','oh, man. poor thing.  yah, the hacking it just from her probably not wanting to take the pill and being forced. What symptoms made you take her to\r\n the vet first place?'),(27462,'dogtimemedia.com','guest6727','2008-11-15 18:21:52','how do I know for sure if my dog is a tree walking coon hound?'),(27463,'dogtimemedia.com','Sandi','2008-11-15 18:21:52','She stated throwing up and got really really weak.'),(27464,'dogtimemedia.com','Sandi','2008-11-15 18:22:29','Her blood work was showing all kinds of serious problem