it'),(28397,'www.lauriescullymusic.co.uk/LSM_BlogZone.html','guestxxx','2008-11-17 15:00:11','bit quiet init'),(28398,'dogtimemedia.com','DogLover1206','2008-11-17 15:01:25','??????'),(28399,'dogtimemedia.com','Maggie','2008-11-17 15:15:01','I\\\'m so glad to hear the Obamas are going to adopt a rescue dog!'),(28400,'dogtimemedia.com','Maggie','2008-11-17 15:15:42','I hear there a tons more dogs in shelters now because of foreclosures'),(28401,'dogtimemedia.com','Maggie','2008-11-17 15:16:05','I can\\\'t imagine how sad that would be to do!'),(28402,'dogtimemedia.com','coop14','2008-11-17 15:18:35','i agree that would be very difficult'),(28403,'dogtimemedia.com','Maggie','2008-11-17 15:19:43','My sister in law had to give up their dog because they moved to London and they make you board the dog for 6 mos'),(28404,'dogtimemedia.com','Maggie','2008-11-17 15:20:14','But she found a good way to do it. She found someone who love Akitas who had lost there dog a few years back'),(28405,'dogtimemedia.com','Maggie','2008-11-17 15:20:32','Thank goodness! They did know what to do.'),(28406,'dogtimemedia.com','Maggie','2008-11-17 15:20:54','They couldn\\\'t put the dog into a boarding kennel for 6 mos. It would have died of a broken heart!'),(28407,'dogtimemedia.com','Maggie','2008-11-17 15:21:05','But, this story had a happy endy'),(28408,'dogtimemedia.com','Maggie','2008-11-17 15:21:35','That\\\'s what\\\'s so great about adopting shelter or rescue dogs.'),(28409,'dogtimemedia.com','coop14','2008-11-17 15:22:28','HOSTED EVENT ALERT: Please join us TODAY (11/17/08) at 4pm PST for the first hosted PetChat event. Expert Leslie Smith will be online to discuss how to adopt a pet and answer questions about this topic.'),(28410,'dogtimemedia.com','Maggie','2008-11-17 15:23:34','We adopted our cats, Blackjack and Sapphire'),(28411,'dogtimemedia.com','Maggie','2008-11-17 15:24:22','We thought she had blue eyes, but they turned green. Didn\\\'t want to change her name at the point-Jade or Emerald would have been more fitting-ha!'),(28412,'dogtimemedia.com','Maggie','2008-11-17 15:24:48','Do you have a pet Coop 14?'),(28413,'dogtimemedia.com','coop14','2008-11-17 15:25:09','i do!  i have a pekingese beagle or a peagle'),(28414,'dogtimemedia.com','coop14','2008-11-17 15:25:22','he\\\'s a great dog - very good mix i must say!'),(28415,'dogtimemedia.com','Maggie','2008-11-17 15:32:03','cute, does it look more like a beagle or a pekingese?'),(28416,'dogtimemedia.com','coop14','2008-11-17 15:33:45','he\\\'s definitely half and half i\\\'d say'),(28417,'dogtimemedia.com','coop14','2008-11-17 15:34:07','he\\\'s got the beagle ears, peke eyes, peke paws, beagle mouth,'),(28418,'dogtimemedia.com','coop14','2008-11-17 15:34:34','he doesn\\\'t bark much which comes from the peke, but when he hear something su@!$@#ious he can howl like a beagle'),(28419,'dogtimemedia.com','coop14','2008-11-17 15:36:48','HOSTED EVENT ALERT: Please join us TODAY (11/17/08) at 4pm PST for the first hosted PetChat event. Expert Leslie Smith will be online to discuss how to adopt a pet and answer questions about this topic.'),(28420,'dogtimemedia.com','Valentine','2008-11-17 15:36:57','hello guest 416 and 5787'),(28421,'dogtimemedia.com','Valentine','2008-11-17 15:37:08','you can participate in the hosted event chat by signing up with a screen name'),(28422,'dogtimemedia.com','Valentine','2008-11-17 15:37:12','it\\\'s super fast and easy'),(28423,'dogtimemedia.com','Valentine','2008-11-17 15:37:14','=)'),(28424,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 15:37:51','Howdy, chatters!'),(28425,'dogtimemedia.com','Valentine','2008-11-17 15:38:11','Hi Leslie!'),(28426,'dogtimemedia.com','Maggie','2008-11-17 15:38:23','Hi, are you The Leslie Smith that I\\\'ve heard on Animal Radio??'),(28427,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 15:38:45','That\\\'s me! Are you a regular listener?'),(28428,'dogtimemedia.com','Valentine','2008-11-17 15:38:46','Thank you so much for taking the time out for this chat!'),(28429,'dogtimemedia.com','Maggie','2008-11-17 15:38:56','Coop 14 What\\\'s your Peagle\\\'s name?'),(28430,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 15:39:07','My pleasure. Animal rescue is my favorite subject.'),(28431,'dogtimemedia.com','dogtimemedia','2008-11-17 15:39:07','cooper!'),(28432,'dogtimemedia.com','Maggie','2008-11-17 15:39:17','Yes, I\\\'ve heard you a lot. Love Road to Rescue. Makes me want to adopt a dog every day!'),(28433,'dogtimemedia.com','Maggie','2008-11-17 15:39:25','oh, coooper\\\'s cute?'),(28434,'dogtimemedia.com','Maggie','2008-11-17 15:39:48','I mean!! not?? :-)'),(28435,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 15:40:58','Which one is Cooper? Do you have a dogpage?'),(28436,'dogtimemedia.com','dogtimemedia','2008-11-17 15:41:30','i haven\\\'t set one up yet, but i will!'),(28437,'dogtimemedia.com','Maggie','2008-11-17 15:42:08','Ha! We\\\'re going to hold you to that one!'),(28438,'dogtimemedia.com','Maggie','2008-11-17 15:42:33','Leslie:What\\\'s the cutest thing Maybe\\\'s done since you adopted her?'),(28439,'dogtimemedia.com','Valentine','2008-11-17 15:42:38','Hi guest 3399~'),(28440,'dogtimemedia.com','Valentine','2008-11-17 15:42:51','the Hosted Event with Leslie Smith is about to start in 15 minutes'),(28441,'dogtimemedia.com','Valentine','2008-11-17 15:43:04','you should log in, or sign up to participate~'),(28442,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 15:43:24','She somehow finds one of my shoes and puts her little snout in it and drifts off to sleep.'),(28443,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 15:43:37','Pretty darn cute, eh Maggie?'),(28444,'dogtimemedia.com','Maggie','2008-11-17 15:44:02','You must have nice smelling feet :-)'),(28445,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 15:44:15','Like roses :)'),(28446,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 15:44:27','Or maybe beef jerky...'),(28447,'dogtimemedia.com','Maggie','2008-11-17 15:44:39','This is gross but my cats used to love my husband\\\'s arm pits!'),(28448,'dogtimemedia.com','Maggie','2008-11-17 15:44:50','Especially after a long run-ewww!'),(28449,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 15:45:09','That is truly weird.'),(28450,'dogtimemedia.com','Maggie','2008-11-17 15:45:11','And at least she\\\'s not chewing your shoes!!'),(28451,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 15:45:34','Definitely, it could be worse.'),(28452,'dogtimemedia.com','Maggie','2008-11-17 15:45:55','Has she chewed anything bad yet?'),(28453,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 15:46:06','Funny you should ask...'),(28454,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 15:46:29','She loves pens. When the humans leave the house, she goes straight for the ballpoint pens.'),(28455,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 15:46:37','She\\\'s already ruined two of my favorites.'),(28456,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 15:46:48','Only a writer would have favorite pens, I suppose.'),(28457,'dogtimemedia.com','Valentine','2008-11-17 15:47:01','Hi Coolgirl188, welcome to the Hosted Events with Leslie Smith!'),(28458,'dogtimemedia.com','Valentine','2008-11-17 15:47:08','it\\\'s going to start in about 10 minutes'),(28459,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 15:47:25','Hi Coolgirl. Welcome.'),(28460,'dogtimemedia.com','dogtimemedia','2008-11-17 15:47:34','HOSTED EVENT ALERT: Please join us TODAY (11/17/08) at 4pm PST for the first hosted PetChat event. Expert Leslie Smith will be online to discuss how to adopt a pet and answer questions about this topic.'),(28461,'dogtimemedia.com','Maggie','2008-11-17 15:47:48','Does she get ink on her mouth?'),(28462,'dogtimemedia.com','Maggie','2008-11-17 15:47:56','maybe she\\\'s jealous of the pens!'),(28463,'dogtimemedia.com','Coolgirl188','2008-11-17 15:48:07','Hi I am new'),(28464,'dogtimemedia.com','Coolgirl188','2008-11-17 15:48:36','What are you guys talking about'),(28465,'dogtimemedia.com','Maggie','2008-11-17 15:48:40','Do you have a pet Coolgirl?'),(28466,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 15:48:47','I don\\\'t know. I was hoping it would encourage her to spout at some words, but no luck yet'),(28467,'dogtimemedia.com','Coolgirl188','2008-11-17 15:48:53','yes it\\\'s a cat'),(28468,'dogtimemedia.com','Maggie','2008-11-17 15:49:02','We were talking about Leslie\\\'s dog liking to eat her pens'),(28469,'dogtimemedia.com','Maggie','2008-11-17 15:49:13','What\\\'s your cat\\\'s name?'),(28470,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 15:50:22','No dogs for you, Coolgirl?'),(28471,'dogtimemedia.com','Maggie','2008-11-17 15:51:02','We\\\'re non partisan here, dogs, cats, birds, whatever works!'),(28472,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 15:51:32','Hope I didn\\\'t offend -- I think she left the chat :('),(28473,'dogtimemedia.com','Maggie','2008-11-17 15:51:52','Not to worry, people drop in out a lot'),(28474,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 15:52:43','True. I\\\'ll keep my stories short!'),(28475,'dogtimemedia.com','Maggie','2008-11-17 15:54:16','6 minutes and counting. DTM, got your moderator Intro for Leslie \nready??'),(28476,'dogtimemedia.com','dogtimemedia','2008-11-17 15:54:33','yup all set!'),(28477,'dogtimemedia.com','Maggie','2008-11-17 15:55:38','cool!'),(28478,'dogtimemedia.com','dogtimemedia','2008-11-17 15:59:19','HOSTED EVENT STARTING\n:  Welcome to PetChat\\\'s first hosted event. Leslie Smith is DogTime\\\'s Senior Editor and is the star of the radio show Road to Rescue and the parent of two adoptive pets is here to answer your questions about adopting a shelter or rescue dog.'),(28479,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:00:02','Hello, pet chatters!'),(28480,'dogtimemedia.com','Valentine','2008-11-17 16:00:13','Hi Leslie!  Thanks again for giving us your time to chat'),(28481,'dogtimemedia.com','dogtimemedia','2008-11-17 16:00:20','hello!'),(28482,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:00:27','My pleasure.'),(28483,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:00:45','The adoption of my own shelter dog, Uno, changed my life.'),(28484,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:01:09','So I\\\'m thrilled to share my experience and knowledge with others...'),(28485,'dogtimemedia.com','dogtimemedia','2008-11-17 16:01:10','how so?'),(28486,'dogtimemedia.com','dogtimemedia','2008-11-17 16:01:28','i mean how did adopting uno change your life?'),(28487,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:01:48','Well, before Uno, I worked in the corporate retail world. But...'),(28488,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:02:11','after a few months with Uno, I realized I needed to pursue animal welfare full time.'),(28489,'dogtimemedia.com','Maggie','2008-11-17 16:02:41','Wow, that\\\'s cool'),(28490,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:02:42','I started volunteering at a shelter'),(28491,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:02:52','2 days a week'),(28492,'dogtimemedia.com','Maggie','2008-11-17 16:03:09','how do dogs end up in shelters?'),(28493,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:03:12','and then eventually began writing about rescue'),(28494,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:03:34','So many reasons dogs end up in shelters'),(28495,'dogtimemedia.com','Speeeeeeeed','2008-11-17 16:03:53','Leslie, you mentioned you adopted your dog, what \nattributes should one look for in a shelter dog?'),(28496,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:03:55','Lately, the housing foreclosure crisis'),(28497,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:04:06','has forced many people to give up their pets'),(28498,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:04:33','as they move into apartments or just can\\\'t afford them any longer'),(28499,'dogtimemedia.com','Maggie','2008-11-17 16:04:36','I was wondering the same thing, how do you know what to look for?'),(28500,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:04:41','But many times'),(28501,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:05:04','these are loving, friendly animals'),(28502,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:05:28','The main thing to look for is friendliness'),(28503,'dogtimemedia.com','todddog1','2008-11-17 16:05:41','Hi Leslie, can you recommend a dog breed that is good for a small apartment and a big city like New York?'),(28504,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:05:47','Does the dog come to the front of the kennel when you approach'),(28505,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:06:00','wag his tail, that sort of thing.'),(28506,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:06:15','Hi Todd. Yes...'),(28507,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:06:36','A greyhound actually makes a terrific apartment dog'),(28508,'dogtimemedia.com','todddog1','2008-11-17 16:06:52','really??? wow!  why is that?'),(28509,'dogtimemedia.com','Maggie','2008-11-17 16:07:02','I read the Obama girls want to get a Westie, I bet that would make a good apt dog'),(28510,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:07:06','But there are plenty, check out this list:'),(28511,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:07:16','http://dogtime.com/good-apartment-dogs-list.html'),(28512,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:07:41','Well, greyhounds are actually great big snugglers'),(28513,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:07:53','Even though they\\\'re fast runners,'),(28514,'dogtimemedia.com','Maggie','2008-11-17 16:08:10','My brother adopted a greyhound and it was incrediby docile.'),(28515,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:08:15','they\\\'re very mellow, calm dogs usually'),(28516,'dogtimemedia.com','todddog1','2008-11-17 16:08:27','wow! who knew? do they need daily running?'),(28517,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:08:45','They do need daily exercise,'),(28518,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:09:18','but even if you\\\'re not an avid runner, you can still ensure yours gets enough'),(28519,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:09:35','through walks, hikes, fetch, etc.'),(28520,'dogtimemedia.com','todddog1','2008-11-17 16:09:37','are there concerns I should have or look for considering that they were bred for speed racing?'),(28521,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:10:18','I would give the same advice...'),(28522,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:10:26','I tell anyone looking to rescue a dog.'),(28523,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:10:36','If it\\\'s your first...'),(28524,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:10:57','my advice is to go for a friendly dog'),(28525,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:11:02','as opposed to a shy one'),(28526,'dogtimemedia.com','Maggie','2008-11-17 16:11:11','How do you tell if they\\\'re unfriendly?'),(28527,'dogtimemedia.com','Dog fun 45','2008-11-17 16:11:11','hello'),(28528,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:11:19','Not that the shy ones are bad, per se, just more work'),(28529,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:11:37','Signs that a dog is friendly include'),(28530,'dogtimemedia.com','Maggie','2008-11-17 16:11:42','Hello Dog fun 45, we\\\'re having a Q & A with Leslie Smith about adopting shelter dogs'),(28531,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:12:02','readily approaching the front of the cage or kennel,'),(28532,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:12:11','making eye contact...'),(28533,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:12:19','though not prolonged eye contact'),(28534,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:12:40','tail wagging that is neither frantic'),(28535,'dogtimemedia.com','Valentine','2008-11-17 16:12:54','why not prolonged eye contact\n?'),(28536,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:12:55','nor tucked'),(28537,'dogtimemedia.com','Dog fun 45','2008-11-17 16:13:08','is dog lover there'),(28538,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:13:13','Usually prolonged eye contact is a sign of'),(28539,'dogtimemedia.com','Maggie','2008-11-17 16:13:14','that\\\'s interesting, if they look at you too long, does that mean their aggressive?'),(28540,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:13:25','fear and sometimes even aggression'),(28541,'dogtimemedia.com','Maggie','2008-11-17 16:13:35','oops got ahead of you!'),(28542,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:13:41','It could, Maggie.'),(28543,'dogtimemedia.com','Valentine','2008-11-17 16:13:43','ahhhh, i see, makes perfect sense'),(28544,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:13:55','It\\\'s a subjective call,'),(28545,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:14:03','and it\\\'s important to look at'),(28546,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:14:10','the dog\\\'s entire body language'),(28547,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:14:32','If you\\\'re adopting from a shelter...'),(28548,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:14:48','the adoption counselors can be great resources and'),(28549,'dogtimemedia.com','Valentine','2008-11-17 16:14:48','Leslie, how long do you think it takes for a rescued dog to fully adjust to home life after adoption?'),(28550,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:15:04','may be able to help you \\\"read\\\" a particular dog'),(28551,'dogtimemedia.com','Dog fun 45','2008-11-17 16:15:06','got to go.g to g'),(28552,'dogtimemedia.com','dogtimemedia','2008-11-17 16:15:17','HOSTED EVENT ALERT:  Welcome to PetChat\\\'s first hosted event. Leslie Smith is DogTime\\\'s Senior Editor and is the star of the radio show Road to Rescue and the parent of two adoptive pets is here to answer your questions about adopting a shelter or rescue dog.'),(28553,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:15:21','Great question, Valentine'),(28554,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:15:42','Of course, it varies. But I would say'),(28555,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:15:48','that complete adjustment'),(28556,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:15:54','takes about 6 months'),(28557,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:16:00','unless...'),(28558,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:16:21','the dog is very young, like 14 weeks or younger'),(28559,'dogtimemedia.com','Valentine','2008-11-17 16:16:23','what are some things I can do to help a rescued pet adjust better/faster?'),(28560,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:16:31','and then the adjustment period will be quicker'),(28561,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:16:42','Another great question'),(28562,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:17:10','Make sure s/he feels safe in the environment, and by this I mean...'),(28563,'dogtimemedia.com','todddog1','2008-11-17 16:17:23','Hi Leslie, this is Todd, I have a question about adopting cats.'),(28564,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:17:24','establish a routine early on,'),(28565,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:17:42','use positive reinforcement training methods,'),(28566,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:17:57','set boundaries and stick to them'),(28567,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:18:14','and don\\\'t be stingy with the praise and affection!'),(28568,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:18:24','Fire away, Todd.'),(28569,'dogtimemedia.com','Valentine','2008-11-17 16:18:27','I never am!'),(28570,'dogtimemedia.com','todddog1','2008-11-17 16:18:37','Is there a rule of thumb to look for when considering a cat for adoption?  How do I know what their personality will be like.'),(28571,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:19:02','Cats are tougher.'),(28572,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:19:08','This is really when you need to'),(28573,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:19:19','rely on the knowledge of the shelter worker'),(28574,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:19:41','But...'),(28575,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:19:58','of course you can garner some very rudimentary information'),(28576,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:20:07','from the cat\\\'s initial behavior.'),(28577,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:20:26','Basic stuff. Is she fearful? Does she hide when you approach? Hiss?'),(28578,'dogtimemedia.com','todddog1','2008-11-17 16:21:23','are those all bad signs?'),(28579,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:21:58','Well, if you\\\'re looking for a friendly cat'),(28580,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:22:29','a hider or hisser may not be the cat for you!'),(28581,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:22:43','Again, this is very subjective and'),(28582,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:23:08','shelter workers can give you a more well-rounded @!$@#essment'),(28583,'dogtimemedia.com','todddog1','2008-11-17 16:23:25','any tips I should know for introducing an adopted cat to my current dog and cat?'),(28584,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:23:51','yes!'),(28585,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:24:48','the main thing is...'),(28586,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:25:15','making sure your cat feels like s/he has an escape route'),(28587,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:26:04','that is, if she\\\'s frightened or feeling threatened, she knows she can climb to the top of her scratching post'),(28588,'dogtimemedia.com','Dog fun 45','2008-11-17 16:26:05','ha im bake'),(28589,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:26:13','a great article, Todd:'),(28590,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:26:22','http://dogtime.com/introducing-dog-and-cat.html'),(28591,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:26:34','Hi Dog fun!'),(28592,'dogtimemedia.com','Valentine','2008-11-17 16:26:55','Leslie, I\\\'ve never adopted before, could you briefly go over the process such as costs, and what I need to bring to the shelters?'),(28593,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:27:20','Usually there\\\'s an adoption fee'),(28594,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:27:31','ranging from $30 to $200'),(28595,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:27:47','a tenth of the cost of buying from a breeder, by the way!'),(28596,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:27:58','And as far as paperwork,'),(28597,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:28:13','many shelters require proof that you own your home OR'),(28598,'dogtimemedia.com','dogtimemedia','2008-11-17 16:28:18','HOSTED EVENT ALERT:  Welcome to PetChat\\\'s first hosted event. Leslie Smith is DogTime\\\'s Senior Editor and is the star of the radio show Road to Rescue and the parent of two adoptive pets is here to answer your questions about adopting a shelter or rescue dog.'),(28599,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:28:36','that you have written permission from your landlord that pets are allowed in your building'),(28600,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:29:02','If you already have a pet,'),(28601,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:29:27','some shelters require proof that they\\\'re up to date on their shots'),(28602,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:30:11','No one\\\'s going to ask you for your SAT scores'),(28603,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:30:35','or your high school GPA :)'),(28604,'dogtimemedia.com','Maggie','2008-11-17 16:31:32','what about if I have another pet?'),(28605,'dogtimemedia.com','todddog1','2008-11-17 16:32:30','Leslie, I have heard that some shelters pay your home a visit to determine if your home is suitable.  Is this normal??'),(28606,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:32:49','You definitely need to bring your current dog to meet and greet'),(28607,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:33:12','any dog dog you\\\'re considering bringing home'),(28608,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:33:36','Good question, Todd'),(28609,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:33:59','I wouldn\\\'t say that it\\\'s common'),(28610,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:34:02','but'),(28611,'dogtimemedia.com','Maggie','2008-11-17 16:34:18','Wow that\\\'s intense, but I can see why'),(28612,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:34:38','it\\\'s not completely unheard of'),(28613,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:34:46','Many agencies...'),(28614,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:34:56','simply want to make sure'),(28615,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:35:37','their animals are going to permanent homes'),(28616,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:36:14','he'),(28617,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:36:36','animal is not going to be returned after a month or two'),(28618,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:37:29','Every shelter and rescue group...'),(28619,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:37:41','has their own policy'),(28620,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:38:50','But the goal is the same:'),(28621,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:39:02','getting as many animals into good homes'),(28622,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:39:08','as possible'),(28623,'dogtimemedia.com','todddog1','2008-11-17 16:42:36','Leslie, do all shelters automatically spay and neuter the pets for adoption?'),(28624,'dogtimemedia.com','Speeeeeeeed','2008-11-17 16:42:36','when looking into adoption, what cost as @!$@#ociated with it?'),(28625,'dogtimemedia.com','Maggie','2008-11-17 16:42:36','What if you have a specific breed in mind that you want to get?'),(28626,'dogtimemedia.com','dogtimemedia','2008-11-17 16:42:50','HOSTED EVENT ALERT:  Welcome to PetChat\\\'s first hosted event. Lesl