slieSmith','2008-11-17 16:50:59','If  you adopt a puppy...'),(28644,'dogtimemedia.com','Speeeeeeeed','2008-11-17 16:52:48','do rescue/shelter dogs need any additional vet care after they are adopted?'),(28645,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:53:55','Sometimes.  But,'),(28646,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:54:20','any re@!$@#ble shelter or rescue org will'),(28647,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:54:35','let you you know of any medical issues in advance'),(28648,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:54:50','Other than that,'),(28649,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:55:31','you\\\'ll just have to be prepared for the normal medical ups and downs of owning a dog'),(28650,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:57:05','..As  do ear infections\n...'),(28651,'dogtimemedia.com','Speeeeeeeed','2008-11-17 16:57:23','doesn\\\'t sound too bad. thanks'),(28652,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:57:39','Sorry, part of my response was cut off'),(28653,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:58:27','I was just saying that you can expect upset stomachs, ear infections, etc. every once in a while'),(28654,'dogtimemedia.com','dogtimemedia','2008-11-17 16:59:49','Thank you for participating in our hosted event about adopting a pet with Leslie Smith, Dogtimeâ€™s Senior Editor and star of the radio show Road to Rescue.  If youâ€™d like a copy of the chat dialog, please email us at info@dogtimemedia.com.'),(28655,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 16:59:56','Diarrhea happens, after all.'),(28656,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 17:00:17','Just had to get that last line in there!'),(28657,'dogtimemedia.com','LeslieSmith','2008-11-17 17:00:26','Thanks for chatting, everyone!'),(28658,'dogtimemedia.com','dogtimemedia','2008-11-17 17:00:57','No worries!  Thank you for your time and well informed answers.'),(28659,'dogtimemedia.com','dogtimemedia','2008-11-17 17:01:25','Th