,'2008-11-30 03:49:18','Humans react spontaneously on occasions like this. Bombayites showed their restraint for not indulging into senseless public property destruction. Angry, every Indian is on the complecency of the Govt. and its slow motion response.'),(37208,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=HomePage&id=3485ae61-5e2d-439f-90f2-e3137f5de38e&MatchID1=4858&TeamID1=1&TeamID2=5&MatchType1=1&SeriesID1=1224&MatchID2=4863&TeamID3=9&TeamID4=8&MatchType2=2&SeriesID2=1225&PrimaryID=4858&Headline=WeÃƒÂ¢Ã‚â‚¬Ã‚â„¢re+all+Bombayites+today','guest1851','2008-11-30 04:35:00','Mr Sanghvi'),(37209,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=HomePage&id=3485ae61-5e2d-439f-90f2-e3137f5de38e&MatchID1=4858&TeamID1=1&TeamID2=5&MatchType1=1&SeriesID1=1224&MatchID2=4863&TeamID3=9&TeamID4=8&MatchType2=2&SeriesID2=1225&PrimaryID=4858&Headline=WeÃƒÂ¢Ã‚â‚¬Ã‚â„¢re+all+Bombayites+today','guest1851','2008-11-30 04:35:17','Mr Sanghvi'),(37210,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=HomePage&id=3485ae61-5e2d-439f-90f2-e3137f5de38e&MatchID1=4858&TeamID1=1&TeamID2=5&MatchType1=1&SeriesID1=1224&MatchID2=4863&TeamID3=9&TeamID4=8&MatchType2=2&SeriesID2=1225&PrimaryID=4858&Headline=WeÃƒÂ¢Ã‚â‚¬Ã‚â„¢re+all+Bombayites+today','guest1851','2008-11-30 04:36:26','Mr Sanghvi  In true secular style, you have blamed everyone except Sonia Mata who is always above these little things.'),(37211,'www.zeenews.com','guest2326','2008-11-30 04:42:16','hi'),(37212,'www.zeenews.com','guest3045','2008-11-30 04:43:35','Sir,\r\n\r\nWhat ever happened in past few days and the inaction of Govt. against the terrorist, and maintaining relations with neighbouring country the mother land of terrorist, just to secure vote bank, allowing them to come to our coutnry stay get fed and destroy the basic fabrics of the coutnry is nothng but shows their incapability. So many sacrifices are going in vain due to these idiot politicians and their policy of apea@!$@#t. It is now time for media and pubnlic to come together as happened at the time of Independence war of freedom when public united and wokeup against the british regime. It is request from your esteem channel to help this coutnry men to get united not only against terrorism but also agains these politicians also and find out our leader who can lead the country i better manner. We Indians are capable of doing any thing then why not to throw out these politicians. Enough is enough.\r\n\r\nMukesh,\r\n\r\n2/24. Antophill\r\n\r\nMumbai, 9819709926.'),(37213,'www.zeenews.com','guest2326','2008-11-30 04:44:30','I agree with guest1898, India has a long history of blaming Pak. 2001 attacks in parliment was a lie, train bombing in india there own local terrorists were involved, I request Indian media to stop negative prapoganda and take this matter towards peace not war.'),(37214,'www.zeenews.com','guest3045','2008-11-30 04:46:42','The security and investigating agency of our country should be librated from these politician and the security provided to them be withdrawn and it should be used for the sake of nation and its citizen instead of parliamentarians and investigating thier scams.'),(37215,'www.zeenews.com','guest3045','2008-11-30 04:52:10','errorism is not enough. The hands should be detected and be cut and thrown properly. BUt over Govt. is busy every time since 1993 from where terrorist came, what they brought, givnig live telecast on media channels as to how profesionally they shoot our people. and to face such sophesticated weapons our Govt. provide canes, out dated rifels and for patrolling sea boats which are not even capable to catch fish at sea s@!$@#, the amount spent in the name of sea patrolling by teh Govt. is not even enough to meet the diesel cost if really the patrolling done to cover the coastal area of Maharashtra. It is surprising that home minister went to TAj today with Ram Gopal verma, is he NSG commando or RR patil now want to make film to show his capability as to how he makes statement and runs the ministry.'),(37216,'www.zeenews.com','guest2326','2008-11-30 04:56:12','how much truth indian media is telling you? 1. First they said, there were 9 britons involved,, NOw there isnt any. HOw come? 2. they said they came by boat, NOW they been living there for more than a month? How comwe? 3. They gave the name of pak naval ships named \\\"Alkabir\\\" and \\\"Alpha\\\" who dropped terrorist on mumbai coast. AGAIN: Pak naval hasnt got any ships with these names and the ship called \\\"ALPHA\\\" belongs to Panama... Grow up Indians. make you mind. and if u want war then u know you cant win it coz muslims loves to die...'),(37217,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/FullcoverageStoryPage.aspx?id=dc353ea5-8202-4d87-a9a1-4791b634c667Mumbaiunderattack_Special&MatchID1=4858&TeamID1=1&TeamID2=5&MatchType1=1&SeriesID1=1224&MatchID2=4863&TeamID3=9&TeamID4=8&MatchType2=2&SeriesID2=1225&PrimaryID=4858&Headline=Shivraj+Patil+quits,+P+Chidambaram+takes+charge','guest5221','2008-11-30 04:59:27','hi'),(37218,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/FullcoverageStoryPage.aspx?id=bf94c0d5-6847-4b35-b6e0-be5a4f4fba21Mumbaiunderattack_Special&MatchID1=4858&TeamID1=1&TeamID2=5&MatchType1=1&SeriesID1=1224&MatchID2=4863&TeamID3=9&TeamID4=8&MatchType2=2&SeriesID2=1225&PrimaryID=4858&Headline=Defeat+or+victory+determined+by+response','Tilak','2008-11-30 05:04:38','Pathetic and clueless piece of writing. Should stick to writing pulp fiction for Hampstead housewives. Perhaps this is his application to succeed the monumentally incompetetent Shivraj Patil as HM though someone else, known only for his pomposity, appears to have beaten him to it\r\n.'),(37219,'www.zeenews.com','guest7496','2008-11-30 05:32:12','hello'),(37220,'www.zeenews.com','guest7496','2008-11-30 05:34:46','any one there'),(37221,'www.zeenews.com','guest7496','2008-11-30 05:34:50','to chat'),(37222,'www.zeenews.com','guest7496','2008-11-30 05:34:51','plz'),(37223,'www.zeenews.com','guest4913','2008-11-30 05:35:10','yes'),(37224,'www.zeenews.com','guest4913','2008-11-30 05:36:56','it is all dirty politics'),(37225,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/FullcoverageStoryPage.aspx?id=5e03c0c8-c478-4ade-b225-062496848d5cMumbaiunderattack_Special&MatchID1=4858&TeamID1=1&TeamID2=5&MatchType1=1&SeriesID1=1224&MatchID2=4863&TeamID3=9&TeamID4=8&MatchType2=2&SeriesID2=1225&PrimaryID=4858&Headline=Mumbai+begins+to+heal+after+rampage','guest1240','2008-11-30 06:07:49','Thank heavens, the Mumbai ordeal is over. \n \nLooking for explanations I wonder whether the peculiar structure of Indian society has something to do with that. I refer to a Ph.D. thesis  Representation and the Politics of Caste written by Chris Verschoote a Belgian sociologist at the Katholieke Universiteit Brussel. \n \nI also remember V.S. Naipaul, the Caribbean writer and Nobel Literary Prize winner, linking the dharma system to many problems of the Indian society. In Vidiadhar Surajprasad Naipaul\\\'s way of thinking dharma in the Indian context can justify every form of unfairness. \n \nIt puzzles me that every Hindu is in his right to search for his own dharma.'),(37226,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/FullcoverageStoryPage.aspx?id=5e03c0c8-c478-4ade-b225-062496848d5cMumbaiunderattack_Special&MatchID1=4858&TeamID1=1&TeamID2=5&MatchType1=1&SeriesID1=1224&MatchID2=4863&TeamID3=9&TeamID4=8&MatchType2=2&SeriesID2=1225&PrimaryID=4858&Headline=Mumbai+begins+to+heal+after+rampage','guest1240','2008-11-30 06:09:01','Thank heavens, the Mumbai ordeal is over. \n \nLooking for explanations I wonder whether the peculiar structure of Indian society has something to do with that. I refer to a Ph.D. thesis  Representation and the Politics of Caste written by Chris Verschoote a Belgian sociologist at the Katholieke Universiteit Brussel. \n \nI also remember V.S. Naipaul, the Caribbean writer and Nobel Literary Prize winner, linking the dharma system to many problems of the Indian society. In Vidiadhar Surajprasad Naipaul\\\'s way of thinking dharma in the Indian context can justify every form of unfairness. \n \nIt puzzles me that every Hindu is in his right to search for his own dharma. [Bill Monkau - Middelburg - The Netherlands]'),(37227,'www.zeenews.com','guest3065','2008-11-30 08:21:36','yeh'),(37228,'www.zeenews.com','guest3065','2008-11-30 08:22:04','hello'),(37229,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/FullcoverageStoryPage.aspx?id=dc353ea5-8202-4d87-a9a1-4791b634c667Mumbaiunderattack_Special&MatchID1=4858&TeamID1=1&TeamID2=5&MatchType1=1&SeriesID1=1224&PrimaryID=4858&Headline=Shivraj+Patil+quits,+P+Chidambaram+takes+charge','guest1430','2008-11-30 08:29:36','what is the point in submitting a resignation? it is just washing off your hands from the situation & running away'),(37230,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=HomePage&id=ec0d5b75-1930-46a4-8d16-8d3df210afee&MatchID1=4858&TeamID1=1&TeamID2=5&MatchType1=1&SeriesID1=1224&PrimaryID=4858&Headline=Media+misrepresented+gun+comment:+Big+B','guest3652','2008-11-30 08:54:08','what else can you expect from the Indian media. Just like Indian security the Indian media can not be trusted either.'),(37231,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=HomePage&id=ec0d5b75-1930-46a4-8d16-8d3df210afee&MatchID1=4858&TeamID1=1&TeamID2=5&MatchType1=1&SeriesID1=1224&PrimaryID=4858&Headline=Media+misrepresented+gun+comment:+Big+B','guest2308','2008-11-30 08:55:07','I think its time that this family should think out of the box. Y would they come and attack him.'),(37232,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=HomePage&id=ec0d5b75-1930-46a4-8d16-8d3df210afee&MatchID1=4858&TeamID1=1&TeamID2=5&MatchType1=1&SeriesID1=1224&PrimaryID=4858&Headline=Media+misrepresented+gun+comment:+Big+B','guest2308','2008-11-30 08:58:31','Innocent people pay the price.Where were all these heroes when Mumbai had come out to cheer our true heroes-the army.'),(37233,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/S