retionary power as per the laid down procedure, why the request was routed through the CM at first place. Who is responsible for this lack of knowledge of '),(37245,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/FullcoverageStoryPage.aspx?id=ec7e84af-17e6-46d9-967b-4dccb5a9abcaMumbaiunderattack_Special&MatchID1=4858&TeamID1=1&TeamID2=5&MatchType1=1&SeriesID1=1224&PrimaryID=4858&Headline=Govt+to+set+up+federal+agency,+says+PM','guest9839','2008-11-30 11:04:20','Furthermore, why only 200 commandos? did they know there were only 10 terrorists? What if there were 50 terrorists?'),(37246,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/FullcoverageStoryPage.aspx?id=ec7e84af-17e6-46d9-967b-4dccb5a9abcaMumbaiunderattack_Special&MatchID1=4858&TeamID1=1&TeamID2=5&MatchType1=1&SeriesID1=1224&PrimaryID=4858&Headline=Govt+to+set+up+federal+agency,+says+PM','guest9839','2008-11-30 11:04:35','the entire India would have been under seige.'),(37247,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/FullcoverageStoryPage.aspx?id=88555522-de37-4a5a-b16b-b6b5aff17aceMumbaiunderattack_Special&MatchID1=4858&TeamID1=1&TeamID2=5&MatchType1=1&SeriesID1=1224&PrimaryID=4858&Headline=Deshmukh+visit+to+Taj+with+RGV+sparks+anger','sulabh5','2008-11-30 11:09:14','Shame on you Mr Deshmukh. This is teh sorry state of indian politics'),(37248,'www.zeenews.com','guest2200','2008-11-30 11:30:44','h'),(37249,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=ViewsSectionPage&id=2bef24e3-bb22-479d-b555-5e9e6f274b96&MatchID1=4858&TeamID1=1&TeamID2=5&MatchType1=1&SeriesID1=1224&PrimaryID=4858&Headline=Night+without+end','guest4805','2008-11-30 11:44:03','Mumbai blasts underline the need for better intelligence. Better intelligence demands more monetary inputs. But the money required for the same is scarce as people continue to be dishonest to their own country. Employess in private companies continue to deposit fake house rent-receipts year after year and rob tax money otherwise due to the goverment.'),(37250,'www.hindustantimes.com/Story