government'),(37390,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/FullcoverageStoryPage.aspx?id=92057c70-5c4e-4d02-9901-e668997738efMumbaiunderattack_Special&&Headline=Mumbai+terror+attacks+could+have+been+stopped','guest8035','2008-12-01 15:15:30','More politicians need to resign'),(37391,'dogtimemedia.com','MaggieC','2008-12-01 15:26:43','Valentine! How are you? Is it cold in Atlanta??'),(37392,'dogtimemedia.com','Valentine','2008-12-01 15:27:10','Hi maggie, yes, it snowed yesterday'),(37393,'dogtimemedia.com','Valentine','2008-12-01 15:27:35','i waited for over 8 hours at the airport due to the snow storm!'),(37394,'dogtimemedia.com','MaggieC','2008-12-01 15:27:37','Yikes! Well it\\\'s gray and gloomy here today, so not a whole lot better'),(37395,'dogtimemedia.com','MaggieC','2008-12-01 15:28:44','Looks like mavens were posting a lot of moderator alerts!'),(37396,'dogtimemedia.com','MaggieC','2008-12-01 15:29:09','Is Channel with you?'),(37397,'dogtimemedia.com','Valentine','2008-12-01 15:29:56','ohhhh, maggie, this is Dorian'),(37398,'dogtimemedia.com','Valentine','2008-12-01 15:30:12','I thought you confused Atlanta with Chicago, which was where i was for Thanksgiving'),(37399,'dogtimemedia.com','MaggieC','2008-12-01 15:33:13','Oh, duh!'),(37400,'dogtimemedia.com','MaggieC','2008-12-01 15:33:34','Glad you make it home from chicago; Amy\\\'s husband is stuck there'),(37401,'dogtimemedia.com','Valentine','2008-12-01 15:34:36','I almost didn\\\'t make it, after four five delays, i had to beg and plead to get on a flight'),(37402,'dogtimemedia.com','Valentine','2008-12-01 15:34:57','I\\\'m actually running on less than two hours of sleep right now, got in way past 4 am today'),(37403,'dogtimemedia.com','coop14','2008-12-01 15:35:26','you will sleep very well tonight i\\\'m sure!'),(37404,'dogtimemedia.com','Valentine','2008-12-01 15:37:17','=)'),(37405,'dogtimemedia.com','MaggieC','2008-12-01 15:37:19','whoa, thanks for hanging in there Dorian!'),(37406,'dogtimemedia.com','Valentine','2008-12-01 15:37:56','coffee is currently ranking really high for the spot of best friend...  =D'),(37407,'dogtimemedia.com','MaggieC','2008-12-01 15:39:25','I bet!'),(37408,'dogtimemedia.com','MaggieC','2008-12-01 15:41:44','Hi shinySC!'),(37409,'dogtimemedia.com','shinySC','2008-12-01 15:41:45','I\\\'m really looking forward to the Q&A today'),(37410,'dogtimemedia.com','shinySC','2008-12-01 15:42:05','my poor dog Mindy has been sick and I think we will eventually have to put her down'),(37411,'dogtimemedia.com','MaggieC','2008-12-01 15:42:06','should be really interesting!'),(37412,'dogtimemedia.com','shinySC','2008-12-01 15:42:12','Hi Maggie'),(37413,'dogtimemedia.com','MaggieC','2008-12-01 15:42:15','Do you have a specific pet you want to ask about?'),(37414,'dogtimemedia.com','shinySC','2008-12-01 15:42:40','I do, my 8 year old Mindy has been extremely sick'),(37415,'dogtimemedia.com','shinySC','2008-12-01 15:42:48','poor girl limps around'),(37416,'dogtimemedia.com','shinySC','2008-12-01 15:42:55','she\\\'s still got spirit though!'),(37417,'dogtimemedia.com','MaggieC','2008-12-01 15:43:29','what has your vet said?'),(37418,'dogtimemedia.com','shinySC','2008-12-01 15:43:57','We are currently running a series of tests right now'),(37419,'dogtimemedia.com','shinySC','2008-12-01 15:44:28','at 8 years, I\\\'m sure there\\\'s a series of health problems that could be the cause'),(37420,'dogtimemedia.com','MaggieC','2008-12-01 15:44:32','well hopefully Bridget can help pin point the problem'),(37421,'dogtimemedia.com','shinySC','2008-12-01 15:44:42','yes!'),(37422,'dogtimemedia.com','MaggieC','2008-12-01 15:45:09','She\\\'ll tell you what she needs to know, but at a minimum when you ask you Q, she\\\'ll need to know your dog\\\'s name, age, @!$@#, and basic issue'),(37423,'dogtimemedia.com','MaggieC','2008-12-01 15:45:42','ha, ha, we have a profanity filter so that\\\'s the funny letters , she\\\'ll need to know the gender of your dog :-)'),(37424,'dogtimemedia.com','shinySC','2008-12-01 15:47:49','gotcha'),(37425,'dogtimemedia.com','shinySC','2008-12-01 15:50:15','hi tom'),(37426,'dogtimemedia.com','Valentine','2008-12-01 15:50:18','hey there tom'),(37427,'dogtimemedia.com','Valentine','2008-12-01 15:50:25','ready for the Q&A about to start soon?'),(37428,'dogtimemedia.com','shinySC','2008-12-01 15:50:54','it should be really good'),(37429,'dogtimemedia.com','dogtimemedia','2008-12-01 15:51:02','Hosted Event Alert: Live Q & A with Expert Animal Behaviorist December 1, 4 p.m. PST Come join behaviorist and animal clairvoyant Bridget Pilloud for a live Q&A.  \nAn expert in intuitive animal communication, Bridget will answer your questions on how to listen and talk to your pets.'),(37430,'dogtimemedia.com','Valentine','2008-12-01 15:51:21','hi there redbonesister'),(37431,'dogtimemedia.com','shinySC','2008-12-01 15:52:00','i guess people are starting to log on for the Q&A'),(37432,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 15:52:06','hi! I made it!'),(37433,'dogtimemedia.com','MaggieC','2008-12-01 15:52:25','Yea, welcome Bridget!!'),(37434,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 15:52:34','This is Bridget Pilloud, your intuitive animal communicator.'),(37435,'dogtimemedia.com','Valentine','2008-12-01 15:52:35','Hi Bridget, thank you so much for taking the time for the Q&A today'),(37436,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 15:52:47','Of course! I\\\'m happy to be here.'),(37437,'dogtimemedia.com','shinySC','2008-12-01 15:53:03','Yes, thank you Bridget, I\\\'m really looking forward to asking some questions'),(37438,'dogtimemedia.com','MaggieC','2008-12-01 15:53:05','It\\\'s been slow today after the Thanksgiving weekend, so hopefully we\\\'ll have some folks coming in soon!'),(37439,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=HomePage&id=22d6a4fd-c4e3-4892-be7b-ca57e9495e12&&Headline=Being+tied+up+in+knots','redbonesister','2008-12-01 15:53:15','hello can i yap about puppies here?'),(37440,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 15:53:19','hi! I made it!'),(37441,'dogtimemedia.com','MaggieC','2008-12-01 15:53:20','thanks for sending that email out!'),(37442,'dogtimemedia.com','dogtimemedia','2008-12-01 15:53:31','HOSTED EVENT ALERT:  Welcome to PetChat\\\'s hosted event with Bridget Pilloud, an expert in intuitive animal communication. Bridget will answer your questions on how to listen and talk to your pets.  Please provide Bridget some background information on your pet â€“ name, breed, age and gender followed by your question.'),(37443,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 15:53:39','This is Bridget Pilloud, your intuitive animal communicator.'),(37444,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 15:53:42','Of course! I\\\'m happy to be here.'),(37445,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 15:53:56','You\\\'re welcome. It went to about 150 people.'),(37446,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=HomePage&id=22d6a4fd-c4e3-4892-be7b-ca57e9495e12&&Headline=Being+tied+up+in+knots','redbonesister','2008-12-01 15:54:28','ok\r\n\\\\'),(37447,'dogtimemedia.com','MaggieC','2008-12-01 15:54:31','Cool, we can officially start in 6 minutes. Might want to type some basic stuff about yourself in a word file to be ready to drop in'),(37448,'dogtimemedia.com','dogtimemedia','2008-12-01 15:54:43','hi bridget i will be posting the hosted event alert again here in a few minutes'),(37449,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 15:54:47','I\\\'ve got it already.'),(37450,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 15:54:55','You\\\'re welcome. It went to about 150 people.'),(37451,'dogtimemedia.com','MaggieC','2008-12-01 15:54:56','great!'),(37452,'dogtimemedia.com','MaggieC','2008-12-01 15:55:44','Hi redbonesister!'),(37453,'dogtimemedia.com','redbonesister','2008-12-01 15:55:56','can some one help me about one month old pups'),(37454,'dogtimemedia.com','redbonesister','2008-12-01 15:56:01','hi maggie'),(37455,'dogtimemedia.com','MaggieC','2008-12-01 15:56:28','Let\\\'s go ahead and get started, what question would youlike to ask Bridget redbonesister?'),(37456,'dogtimemedia.com','dogtimemedia','2008-12-01 15:56:45','HOSTED EVENT ALERT:  Welcome to PetChat\\\'s hosted event with Bridget Pilloud, an expert in intuitive animal communication. Bridget will answer your questions on how to listen and talk to your pets.  Please provide Bridget some background information on your pet â€“ name, breed, age and gender followed by your question.'),(37457,'dogtimemedia.com','redbonesister','2008-12-01 15:56:55','ok I have 4 month old pups and I am at a lost'),(37458,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 15:57:17','What are they doing?'),(37459,'dogtimemedia.com','redbonesister','2008-12-01 15:57:28','I do not know when to start feeding them and the mother is starting to spend more time away from them'),(37460,'dogtimemedia.com','redbonesister','2008-12-01 15:57:50','nothing yet their eyes are open and they r trying to stand but that is about it'),(37461,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 15:57:57','What\\\'s the mother\\\'s name? Are they redbones?'),(37462,'dogtimemedia.com','redbonesister','2008-12-01 15:58:40','the mothers name is twinkie she is at pug and they are pug and yorkie mixed and they were not a planned thing, lol'),(37463,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 15:59:26','Okay. Let me see what I can find out from Twinkie-'),(37464,'dogtimemedia.com','redbonesister','2008-12-01 15:59:56','she is 4'),(37465,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 15:59:58','She\\\'s pretty overwhelmed. She didn\\\'t realize that this motherhood thing would last so long. I reassured her that she only needed to care for them for about a month longer.'),(37466,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:00:16','I think partially the issue is that there are four puppies. That\\\'s a lot for a little dog to deal with.'),(37467,'dogtimemedia.com','redbonesister','2008-12-01 16:00:32','ok so when do i start to take over or about what time'),(37468,'dogtimemedia.com','redbonesister','2008-12-01 16:01:42','she is eating me out of house and home is that normal or is she just being greedy?');
