talk with her to see where it hurts, and also, how she\\\'s dealing with it all, is she in pain\n?  I want her to know that I love her dearly.'),(37485,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:05:15','What color is she?'),(37486,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:05:44','Shiny? What color is she?'),(37487,'dogtimemedia.com','shinySC','2008-12-01 16:05:55','light brown'),(37488,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:06:16','Okay, just a second-'),(37489,'dogtimemedia.com','shinySC','2008-12-01 16:06:25','thank you so much...'),(37490,'dogtimemedia.com','kittens','2008-12-01 16:06:28','hello'),(37491,'dogtimemedia.com','MaggieC','2008-12-01 16:06:52','Hi kittens, we have Bridget on who is animal communicator'),(37492,'dogtimemedia.com','dogtimemedia','2008-12-01 16:07:09','HOSTED EVENT ALERT:  Welcome to PetChat\\\'s hosted event with Bridget Pilloud, an expert in intuitive animal communication. Bridget will answer your questions on how to listen and talk to your pets.  Please provide Bridget some background information on your pet â€“ name, breed, age and gender followed by your question.'),(37493,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:07:43','It\\\'s more nausea than pain. She says that it\\\'s in her \\\"kishkas\\\", which is Yiddish for intestines. I told her that you love her very much and she says that she knows that, and she feels very warm and happy that you had me tell her that.'),(37494,'dogtimemedia.com','shinySC','2008-12-01 16:08:09','intestines...  can it be fixed?'),(37495,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:08:13','I haven\\\'t heard the word \\\"kishkas\\\" in years! What a sweet funny dog!'),(37496,'dogtimemedia.com','kittens','2008-12-01 16:08:26','hello i have a question abaut a cat'),(37497,'dogtimemedia.com','MaggieC','2008-12-01 16:08:34','I didn\\\'t know dogs were religious!'),(37498,'dogtimemedia.com','redbonesister','2008-12-01 16:08:53','Bridget at what age do the puppies usually start eating puppie food is what I am asking?'),(37499,'dogtimemedia.com','kittens','2008-12-01 16:08:59','i have a question.............'),(37500,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:09:10','I don\\\'t know. I\\\'m not a vet. It\\\'s what I\\\'m getting from her. Always check with your vet. Our dogs and cats are a lot like us. They may have an idea what\\\'s wrong, they\\\'re not vets either.'),(37501,'dogtimemedia.com','kittens','2008-12-01 16:09:14','can someone help me'),(37502,'dogtimemedia.com','MaggieC','2008-12-01 16:09:26','Kittens go ahead and ask your question'),(37503,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:09:29','Redbone- about 6 weeks, I think. I don\\\'t know.'),(37504,'dogtimemedia.com','dogtimemedia','2008-12-01 16:09:31','What is your question Kittens?'),(37505,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:09:36','Hey Kittens! Ask your question!'),(37506,'dogtimemedia.com','redbonesister','2008-12-01 16:09:37','oh ok thank u'),(37507,'dogtimemedia.com','redbonesister','2008-12-01 16:09:49','thank u'),(37508,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:10:00','sure. no problem.'),(37509,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:10:21','Kittens?'),(37510,'dogtimemedia.com','redbonesister','2008-12-01 16:10:52','have a good night everyone'),(37511,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:11:06','While we\\\'re waiting for kittens, I\\\'d like to tell you a little bit about what I do.'),(37512,'dogtimemedia.com','MaggieC','2008-12-01 16:11:06','Kittens is still logged in so may be typing question'),(37513,'dogtimemedia.com','MaggieC','2008-12-01 16:11:15','By redbonsister==good luck with puppies'),(37514,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:11:43','I get information from pets in eight different ways. I may hear words, see pictures, get a taste in my mouth or smell a smell.'),(37515,'dogtimemedia.com','redbonesister','2008-12-01 16:11:48','thanks Maggie'),(37516,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:12:10','While we\\\'re waiting for kittens, I\\\'d like to tell you a little bit about what I do.'),(37517,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:12:32','I also sometimes just \\\"know something\\\". I feel emotions and physical sensations.'),(37518,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:12:50','I get information from pets in eight different ways. I may hear words, see pictures, get a taste in my mouth or smell a smell.'),(37519,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:13:06','It\\\'s a sometimes crazy mixture of things. Then I have to put together the puzzle of sensations to figure out'),(37520,'dogtimemedia.com','shinySC','2008-12-01 16:13:06','How do you hone in on a specific animal?'),(37521,'dogtimemedia.com','MaggieC','2008-12-01 16:13:12','Bridget, our co-worker\\\'s dog Channel is going to have teeth surgery next week, can you get in touch with her and let her know we\\\'re thinking about her?'),(37522,'dogtimemedia.com','MaggieC','2008-12-01 16:13:39','She\\\'s a darling yorkshire terrier. I\\\'m sure she\\\'s scared'),(37523,'dogtimemedia.com','kittens','2008-12-01 16:13:47','my dad once scream at our cat te cat is scared a lot what should i do?'),(37524,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:14:00','To hone in, I say the animals name and wait for the animal to say, \\\"Yes?\\\"'),(37525,'dogtimemedia.com','dogtimemedia','2008-12-01 16:14:07','Channel is 4 years old, female \nyorkie terrier'),(37526,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:14:49','I\\\'ll answer Kittens question first. Your cat needs a safe place where she can be herself. Get her a box with a towel in an out of the way place. What\\\'s the cat\\\'s name?'),(37527,'dogtimemedia.com','kittens','2008-12-01 16:14:50','hello....'),(37528,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:15:24','I\\\'m not sure why I\\\'m repeating myself here? Sorry if it looks that way to you.'),(37529,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:15:43','Your cat\\\'s name is Hello?'),(37530,'dogtimemedia.com','kittens','2008-12-01 16:15:47','miley'),(37531,'dogtimemedia.com','MaggieC','2008-12-01 16:15:51','It doesn\\\'t, don\\\'t worry Bridget'),(37532,'dogtimemedia.com','kittens','2008-12-01 16:16:05','my cat name is miley'),(37533,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:16:20','Let me check in with Miley. Hang on-'),(37534,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:17:07','Yep, your cat is pretty freaked out.'),(37535,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:17:34','I told her to take a deep breath. She needs a quiet place and to be told that she\\\'s okay.'),(37536,'dogtimemedia.com','kittens','2008-12-01 16:17:55','ok'),(37537,'dogtimemedia.com','coop14','2008-12-01 16:18:07','bridget i have a question about my dog cooper'),(37538,'dogtimemedia.com','coop14','2008-12-01 16:18:21','he is a 4 year old pekingese beagle mix, male'),(37539,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:18:41','He sounds cute. I bet he hates being called cute though.'),(37540,'dogtimemedia.com','kittens','2008-12-01 16:18:48','my cat is ok with me but miley is scared of my dad'),(37541,'dogtimemedia.com','coop14','2008-12-01 16:18:57','after dinner, when my husband and i relax on the couch he often times just sits in front of us staring  at us and sometimes he\\\'ll wine'),(37542,'dogtimemedia.com','coop14','2008-12-01 16:19:05','what does he want?'),(37543,'dogtimemedia.com','kittens','2008-12-01 16:19:09','what  di i do?'),(37544,'dogtimemedia.com','coop14','2008-12-01 16:19:17','i think he likes being called cute, we call him that all the time'),(37545,'dogtimemedia.com','dogtimemedia','2008-12-01 16:19:38','MODERATOR ALERT:  If questions come in too fast for Bridget to answer, the DogTime Moderators will cue them up in order they are received.'),(37546,'dogtimemedia.com','MaggieC','2008-12-01 16:19:53','Let\\\'s finish with Kittens first'),(37547,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:19:59','Kittens- your dad needs to apologize to her, and then give it some time.'),(37548,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:20:07','What color is Cooper?'),(37549,'dogtimemedia.com','coop14','2008-12-01 16:20:19','he is brown and white'),(37550,'dogtimemedia.com','kittens','2008-12-01 16:20:54','ok'),(37551,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:21:10','The first thing that he mentions is \\\"peanuts\\\".'),(37552,'dogtimemedia.com','coop14','2008-12-01 16:21:32','peanuts?'),(37553,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:21:36','And then he\\\'s showing himself tucked between the two of you on the couch.'),(37554,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:21:49','What is the significance of \\\"peanuts?\\\"'),(37555,'dogtimemedia.com','coop14','2008-12-01 16:22:06','i\\\'m not sure - we\\\'ve fed him peanuts before'),(37556,'dogtimemedia.com','coop14','2008-12-01 16:22:09','and he likes them'),(37557,'dogtimemedia.com','coop14','2008-12-01 16:22:21','and he loves cuddling on the couch with the both of us'),(37558,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:22:29','Let me try to clarify with him what he\\\'s saying.'),(37559,'dogtimemedia.com','kittens','2008-12-01 16:23:00','after coop can you anserw another question please'),(37560,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:23:18','I asked him if he wanted peanuts and he said \\\"Yes\\\". Then I asked him about sitting on the couch. He said he\\\'d like to sit on the couch between the two of you.'),(37561,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:23:39','And put his head in your lap and have your Hubby scratch his backside. That would be ideal.'),(37562,'dogtimemedia.com','coop14','2008-12-01 16:23:55','i see - he loves all these things so that\\\'s great!'),(37563,'dogtimemedia.com','coop14','2008-12-01 16:24:00','thanks!'),(37564,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:24:12','He is the kind of dog that really does best when he is touching one of his humans. It\\\'s comforting and grounding.'),(37565,'dogtimemedia.com','shinySC','2008-12-01 16:24:18','(I have another question regarding Mindy as well when others have had a turn please...)'),(37566,'dogtimemedia.com','MaggieC','2008-12-01 16:24:37','I think Kittens had a question'),(37567,'dogtimemedia.com','coop14','2008-12-01 16:24:38','makes sense, thank you!'),(37568,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:24:45','I was going to talk to Channel next, I think.'),(37569,'dogtimemedia.com','kittens','2008-12-01 16:24:47','yes i did'),(37570,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:25:02','Let me just check in with her and then to kittens and then to Shiny?'),(37571,'dogtimemedia.com','shinySC','2008-12-01 16:25:33','thank you'),(37572,'dogtimemedia.com','kittens','2008-12-01 16:25:51','my cat is way to fat'),(37573,'dogtimemedia.com','kittens','2008-12-01 16:26:00','im worried'),(37574,'dogtimemedia.com','kittens','2008-12-01 16:26:19','she once eat chocolate!'),(37575,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:26:38','Channel was a little apprehensive, but is better now. She wants to come into work. I told her about the process and now that she knows what to expect, her first question was whether she could come back into the office.'),(37576,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:26:53','I assured her that she\\\'d be welcome.'),(37577,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:27:06','Kittens- what\\\'s your question?'),(37578,'dogtimemedia.com','kittens','2008-12-01 16:27:37','my cat is way to fat she once eat chocolate!'),(37579,'dogtimemedia.com','MaggieC','2008-12-01 16:27:55','too cute. we\\\'ll have to sneak Channel in before her surgery, give her a little special day!'),(37580,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:27:57','Okay. Let me talk with her about that.'),(37581,'dogtimemedia.com','kittens','2008-12-01 16:28:49','and then she eat a can but still hungry!'),(37582,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:29:12','She thinks that you think it\\\'s funny that she\\\'s fat. She\\\'s not concerned about it. It\\\'s all about portion control with cats. Feed a high-quality food and make sure that you feed according to the directions. If she\\\'s still hungry, then she has to wait until the next meal.'),(37583,'dogtimemedia.com','kittens','2008-12-01 16:29:22','mi ley is not one year'),(37584,'dogtimemedia.com','kittens','2008-12-01 16:29:39','ok'),(37585,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:30:01','My cats love tuna. They\\\'d eat it every day if they could. We now have \\\"Tuna Sunday\\\", where they get tuna on Sunday. That\\\'s it. Otherwise it\\\'s kibble.'),(37586,'dogtimemedia.com','kittens','2008-12-01 16:30:04','mmy cat growls a lot'),(37587,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:30:32','She thinks that you think it\\\'s funny that she\\\'s fat. She\\\'s not concerned about it. It\\\'s all about portion control with cats. Feed a high-quality food and make sure that you feed according to the directions. If she\\\'s still hungry, then she has to wait until the next meal.'),(37588,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:30:51','She is a real sweetheart, your cat. I like her. I\\\'m glad you\\\'re close to her. How about Shiny\\\'s question now?'),(37589,'dogtimemedia.com','kittens','2008-12-01 16:31:10','thanks alot be right back....'),(37590,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:31:10','My cats love tuna. They\\\'d eat it every day if they could. We now have \\\"Tuna Sunday\\\", where they get tuna on Sunday. That\\\'s it. Otherwise it\\\'s kibble.'),(37591,'dogtimemedia.com','shinySC','2008-12-01 16:31:11','Thank you.  \nMindy was born with a faulty heart valve and has had health complications for her whole life.'),(37592,'dogtimemedia.com','shinySC','2008-12-01 16:31:21','My mother has been taking care of her and I feel guilty that I can not go to visit her often because of my busy work schedule.  Does she know that I love her, does she love me, and understand my obligations deter me from seeing her often?  Also, what would she like from me, what can I do?'),(37593,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:31:40','Ah, okay, let me check.'),(37594,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:32:15','She is a real sweetheart, your cat. I like her. I\\\'m glad you\\\'re close to her. How about Shiny\\\'s question now?'),(37595,'dogtimemedia.com','shinySC','2008-12-01 16:32:22','Thank you so much Bridget,'),(37596,'dogtimemedia.com','mymuncher','2008-12-01 16:32:39','Bridget, I have a question when you have a moment.'),(37597,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:33:14','Okay, she told me that she misses you. That was the first thing she said. Then I told her that you were very busy working.'),(37598,'dogtimemedia.com','shinySC','2008-12-01 16:33:34','awwww... poor mindy...'),(37599,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:33:45','She said, \\\"Working?\\\" I said, \\\"Yes.\\\" I think she felt better knowing what you\\\'re doing. I asked her what you could do for her.'),(37600,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:34:18','And she said that she\\\'d like it if you could go with her to a park and sit with her on a sunny day. She\\\'d just like to sit with you outside.'),(37601,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:34:34','She likes your mom\\\'s place quite a bit, and is mostly happy there, but she misses you.'),(37602,'dogtimemedia.com','shinySC','2008-12-01 16:34:36','i see...  I\\\'ll make sure to do that...'),(37603,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:34:53','She is all about simple, quiet pleasures.'),(37604,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:35:17','Okay mymuncher? What\\\'s your question?'),(37605,'dogtimemedia.com','mymuncher','2008-12-01 16:3