is complaining about skin issues. They may be related to allergies.'),(37620,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:39:48','He had some sort of bath at some point that was quite soothing. Was this with you? He\\\'d like that again.'),(37621,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:39:54','Never had a dog ask for a bath before!'),(37622,'dogtimemedia.com','kittens','2008-12-01 16:40:23','maggieC you help petsaretalking?'),(37623,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:40:44','Also, I\\\'m getting the word \\\"respiratory\\\". It\\\'s not from Munch, but just sort of coming through.'),(37624,'dogtimemedia.com','MaggieC','2008-12-01 16:40:58','I work for dogtime and helping. I asked Bridget to come host this event'),(37625,'www.hindustantimes.com/PhotoGallery/SlidePhoto.aspx?Photo=c7008477-37c3-47a5-965a-cae79d4312ad','guest1214','2008-12-01 16:41:04','After the hot kiss, both are very much tight lipped - as if nothing happened. :)'),(37626,'dogtimemedia.com','mymuncher','2008-12-01 16:41:09','OK. I give him a bath every week and he shakes less (like he\\\'s less irritated). I will continue to bathe him regularly. Can you tell him it\\\'s really important that he stop eating other animals @!$@# so he stops getting worms and giardia?'),(37627,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:41:10','Toffee- I\\\'ll answer your question as soon as I\\\'m done with Munch.'),(37628,'dogtimemedia.com','kittens','2008-12-01 16:41:22','ok when are you coing back'),(37629,'dogtimemedia.com','toffee','2008-12-01 16:41:26','okay thanks'),(37630,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:41:30','Oh! Yes. I can tell him that.'),(37631,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:42:11','He is telling me that he \\\"needs salt\\\" and that\\\'s why he does it. He may have some mineral deficiencies.'),(37632,'dogtimemedia.com','kittens','2008-12-01 16:42:21','maggieC and petsaretalking when are you coming back?'),(37633,'dogtimemedia.com','tomlover101','2008-12-01 16:42:37','hi'),(37634,'dogtimemedia.com','MyBFLuvsMe','2008-12-01 16:42:44','hey this is real random but my username means                                          My Boyfriend Loves Me'),(37635,'dogtimemedia.com','MaggieC','2008-12-01 16:42:44','we\\\'re  both on Kittens do you have another question?'),(37636,'dogtimemedia.com','mymuncher','2008-12-01 16:42:48','Thank you! I will give him more salty food and check into an allergy test. I love him so much!'),(37637,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:43:24','Dogs eat dookie for a variety of reasons, sometimes it\\\'s stress and sometimes it\\\'s a mineral thing. Oh, don\\\'t give him more salt. He could be describing another mineral.'),(37638,'dogtimemedia.com','kittens','2008-12-01 16:43:30','i hav a question'),(37639,'dogtimemedia.com','MyBFLuvsMe','2008-12-01 16:43:49','oh and my boyfriend said hi lol'),(37640,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:44:04','I wouldn\\\'t want Munch to have high blood pressure! Some holistic vets check for mineral deficits.'),(37641,'dogtimemedia.com','mymuncher','2008-12-01 16:44:09','I think allergy testing is probably in order. Is he stressed out?'),(37642,'dogtimemedia.com','tomlover101','2008-12-01 16:44:34','fine dont @!$@# talk 2 me then'),(37643,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:45:01','I don\\\'t think that Munch is stressed out.'),(37644,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:45:18','He doesn\\\'t strike me as stressed out. I think he feels relieved to be in your care.'),(37645,'dogtimemedia.com','mymuncher','2008-12-01 16:45:33','Good. I really want him to be happy, and healthy.'),(37646,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:45:36','Okay, on to Toffee. Is Toffee Toffee-colored?'),(37647,'dogtimemedia.com','mymuncher','2008-12-01 16:45:38','He\\\'s a good pup.'),(37648,'dogtimemedia.com','mymuncher','2008-12-01 16:45:48','Thanks so much!'),(37649,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:45:53','Yup. Munch is a great dog!'),(37650,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:45:58','Sure.'),(37651,'dogtimemedia.com','kittens','2008-12-01 16:46:03','tom you there??'),(37652,'dogtimemedia.com','toffee','2008-12-01 16:46:14','gold and creme with a little black streak'),(37653,'dogtimemedia.com','kittens','2008-12-01 16:46:27','CAN YOU ANSERW A QUESTION!'),(37654,'dogtimemedia.com','MaggieC','2008-12-01 16:46:28','tomlover101, do you have question???'),(37655,'dogtimemedia.com','doglover16','2008-12-01 16:47:00','i like dogs'),(37656,'dogtimemedia.com','MaggieC','2008-12-01 16:47:21','Hi Kittens ask the question and we\\\'ll cue it up!'),(37657,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:47:22','Oh cute. So Toffee has a fear issue and you\\\'d like him to feel less afraid around people? kids? I can\\\'t find your question.'),(37658,'dogtimemedia.com','toffee','2008-12-01 16:47:37','yes exactly'),(37659,'dogtimemedia.com','kittens','2008-12-01 16:47:50','OK when are you coming back?'),(37660,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:47:51','Okay, let me check in with him.'),(37661,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:47:56','Hang on a second...'),(37662,'dogtimemedia.com','toffee','2008-12-01 16:48:29','ok'),(37663,'dogtimemedia.com','kittens','2008-12-01 16:48:31','to anserw more question..'),(37664,'dogtimemedia.com','doglover16','2008-12-01 16:48:33','are french bulldogs smart?'),(37665,'dogtimemedia.com','kittens','2008-12-01 16:48:47','hello?!'),(37666,'dogtimemedia.com','dogtimemedia','2008-12-01 16:49:01','HOSTED EVENT ALERT:  Welcome to PetChat\\\'s hosted event with Bridget Pilloud, an expert in intuitive animal communication. Bridget will answer your questions on how to listen and talk to your pets.  Please provide Bridget some background information on your pet â€“ name, breed, age and gender followed by your question.'),(37667,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:49:18','Hang on a second...'),(37668,'dogtimemedia.com','toffee','2008-12-01 16:49:28','ok'),(37669,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:49:32','Okay, let me check in with him.'),(37670,'dogtimemedia.com','kittens','2008-12-01 16:49:37','im being ignored.....'),(37671,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:49:52','I\\\'m getting that he\\\'s more mad than scared. He told me that he wants to bite kids. Does that sound like him? He showed me a kid picking him up as a puppy and squeezing him.'),(37672,'dogtimemedia.com','toffee','2008-12-01 16:50:24','he never behaves around kids as if he wants to bite them'),(37673,'dogtimemedia.com','toffee','2008-12-01 16:50:38','he lets them pet him altho clearly he feels uncomfortable'),(37674,'dogtimemedia.com','kittens','2008-12-01 16:50:42','hello!!!!!!!!!!!??????????'),(37675,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:50:48','I\\\'m wondering if I picked up the wrong dog.'),(37676,'dogtimemedia.com','toffee','2008-12-01 16:51:06','it cud be that he was hurt as a kid'),(37677,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:51:08','Sometimes the wrong dog will come through.'),(37678,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:51:11','I\\\'m getting that he\\\'s more mad than scared. He told me that he wants to bite kids. Does that sound like him? He showed me a kid picking him up as a puppy and squeezing him.'),(37679,'dogtimemedia.com','toffee','2008-12-01 16:51:12','i got him recently as an adult'),(37680,'dogtimemedia.com','doglover16','2008-12-01 16:51:43','hey valentine'),(37681,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:51:51','Let me try again.'),(37682,'dogtimemedia.com','Valentine','2008-12-01 16:51:58','hey doglover16'),(37683,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:52:52','Okay, I\\\'ve got Toffee. I\\\'m not sure who that dog was. Toffee wasn\\\'t sure either. Sometimes I\\\'ll get a dog that is in the vicinity of the dog that I want to talk with.'),(37684,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:52:57','Toffee is very sweet.'),(37685,'dogtimemedia.com','toffee','2008-12-01 16:53:35','any insights into his behavior?'),(37686,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:54:26','He hasn\\\'t been severely abused in his past, but he was thunked on the head a few times by kids. He\\\'s showing a kid sort of flicking his finger at his ears.'),(37687,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:55:15','Two things are coming up. One, Toffee has a bit of a tension headache.'),(37688,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:56:16','He is telling me that he\\\'d like people to ask him first, and if he doesn\\\'t shrink away, then he\\\'s okay with pets, but if he shrinks away then he\\\'s not okay with being pet.'),(37689,'dogtimemedia.com','toffee','2008-12-01 16:56:52','that makes sense...he also does not seem to display his affection as most dogs are known to do..will shake his tail ..doesnt lick or jump'),(37690,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:57:00','He is really trying to conquer his fears, but he\\\'s not showing me the thing that caused his fear.'),(37691,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:57:18','It seems like he\\\'s just naturally a little nervous, and his head has a tendency to hurt.'),(37692,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:57:31','perhaps a doggie massage?'),(37693,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:57:39','would be helpful?'),(37694,'dogtimemedia.com','toffee','2008-12-01 16:57:54','we do massage his tummy..what else will make him feel better?'),(37695,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:58:43','He\\\'s a nice dog, but he\\\'s quiet and thoughtful. Dogs love a tummy massage. I was thinking more for his shoulders to relieve his tension headache. Also, make sure he doesn\\\'t jump off the bed or the couch, because dogs of his size can jar their shoulders and get headaches from that too!'),(37696,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:59:01','That should read, \\\"He\\\'s a nice dog, and he\\\'s quiet and thoughtful.\\\"'),(37697,'dogtimemedia.com','toffee','2008-12-01 16:59:27','what about his affection towards us?'),(37698,'dogtimemedia.com','dogtimemedia','2008-12-01 16:59:29','Thank you Bridget so much for your time.  We have time for one more question.'),(37699,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 16:59:57','He likes you quite a bit. He\\\'s just not super-outwardly affectionate.'),(37700,'dogtimemedia.com','Valentine','2008-12-01 17:00:15','I have a question regarding my childhood dog'),(37701,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 17:00:26','Go ahead!'),(37702,'dogtimemedia.com','Valentine','2008-12-01 17:00:44','My childhood dog, Jedi, was a black lab and golden retriever mix.  I had to give him away when I was moving'),(37703,'dogtimemedia.com','Valentine','2008-12-01 17:00:53','last i heard of him, the family that adopted him had to give him up'),(37704,'dogtimemedia.com','Valentine','2008-12-01 17:01:19','because he would constantly break the fence and open locks and ran two miles to my old house'),(37705,'dogtimemedia.com','Valentine','2008-12-01 17:01:34','this was well over a dog\\\'s life span ago and I\\\'m sure he passed....'),(37706,'dogtimemedia.com','Valentine','2008-12-01 17:01:38','are you able to reach him?'),(37707,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 17:01:46','Yep, that\\\'s common. Dogs want to go home.'),(37708,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 17:01:53','Let me try. What did he look like?'),(37709,'dogtimemedia.com','Valentine','2008-12-01 17:01:53','if he was alive, he would be about 17 years old'),(37710,'dogtimemedia.com','Valentine','2008-12-01 17:02:14','looked like a black lab, with white streak down his chest'),(37711,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 17:02:25','Short hair?'),(37712,'dogtimemedia.com','Valentine','2008-12-01 17:02:38','yes'),(37713,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 17:02:49','hang on...'),(37714,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 17:03:57','I found him! He passed away when he was 12. He had a very happy life.'),(37715,'dogtimemedia.com','MaggieC','2008-12-01 17:04:27','Wow, Bridget, this has been wonderful!! You have amazing powers!'),(37716,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 17:04:37','He showed me him hanging out with a guy who liked to surf. It looks like Southern California, but it could be further north.'),(37717,'dogtimemedia.com','MaggieC','2008-12-01 17:04:37','We look forward to having you back on PetChat again!'),(37718,'dogtimemedia.com','Valentine','2008-12-01 17:04:46','awww, did he finally find a good home'),(37719,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 17:05:01','He found a great home with a guy who really loved him. He was renamed Jake.'),(37720,'dogtimemedia.com','dogtimemedia','2008-12-01 17:05:02','Thank you for participating in our hosted event about communicating with your pet with Bridget Pilloud, an expert in intuitive animal communication.  If youâ€™d like a copy of the chat dialog, please visit http://dogtime.com/talk-with-other-pet-lovers-live-on-petchat.html.'),(37721,'dogtimemedia.com','Valentine','2008-12-01 17:05:07','no wayyyyyyyy my hometown is a total surf town!'),(37722,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 17:05:31','The guy had a blue van.'),(37723,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 17:05:49','I\\\'m so happy for you that we found him!'),(37724,'dogtimemedia.com','Valentine','2008-12-01 17:06:12','Thanyou so much Bridget...  even as an adult, it always bothered me that I couldn\\\'t find his whereabouts'),(37725,'dogtimemedia.com','dogtimemedia','2008-12-01 17:06:18','Thank you for participating in our hosted event about communicating with your pet with Bridget Pilloud, an expert in intuitive animal communication.  If youâ€™d like a copy of the chat dialog, please visit http://dogtime.com/talk-with-other-pet-lovers-live-on-petchat.html.'),(37726,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 17:06:19','Well, this has been really fun, everybody. You can find me anytime at my blog: petsaretalking.typepad.com. Give your doggies a hug for me.'),(37727,'dogtimemedia.com','Valentine','2008-12-01 17:06:28','Thank you from the bottom of my heart'),(37728,'dogtimemedia.com','dogtimemedia','2008-12-01 17:06:32','THanks so much Bridget!'),(37729,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 17:06:39','No problem, Valentine. I\\\'m glad he had a good life with you, and afterwards.'),(37730,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 17:06:55','I\\\'m signing out! Good to talk with all of you!'),(37731,'dogtimemedia.com','dogtimemedia','2008-12-01 17:07:03','bye thank you!'),(37732,'dogtimemedia.com','dogtimemedia','2008-12-01 17:07:27','Thank you for participating in our hosted event about communicating with your pet with Bridget Pilloud, an expert in intuitive animal communication.  If youâ€™d like a copy of the chat dialog, please visit http://dogtime.com/talk-with-other-pet-lovers-live-on-petchat.html.'),(37733,'dogtimemedia.com','petsaretalking!','2008-12-01 17:08:16','I\\\'m signing out! Good to talk with all of you!'),(37734,'dogtimemedia.com','Valentine','2008-12-01 17:13:57','That was amazing!'),(37735,'dogtimemedia.com','Valentine','2008-12-01 17:14:05','ok everyone, I\\\'m signing off now, have a great rest of day'),(37736,'dogtimemedia.com','shinySC','2008-12-01 17:14:14','me too, have a good day everyone'),(37737,'dogtimemedia.com','jax\\\'s mom','2008-12-01 17:31:40','hello'),(37738,'dogtimemedia.com','jax\\\'s mom','2008-12-01 17:31:58','hello'),(37739,'dogtimemedia.com','jax\\\'s mom','2008-12-01 17:32:26','anyone in here'),(37740,'dogtimemedia.com','jax\\\'s mom','2008-12-01 17:33:47','hello'),(37741,'dogtimemedia.com','jax\\\'s mom','2008-12-01 17:39:25','hello'),(37742,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPag