s.com/StoryPage/FullcoverageStoryPage.aspx?id=92057c70-5c4e-4d02-9901-e668997738efMumbaiunderattack_Special&&Headline=26/11+could+have+been+stopped','guest3206','2008-12-02 17:51:57','NSA : must be fired, IB and Police need active , intelligent and aggressive people. This sarkari laid back life must be shuned.'),(37829,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=ViewsSectionPage&id=ca0ddccc-f725-4957-91c7-5ba0f568b371&&Headline=No+place+to+hide','guest9239','2008-12-02 18:02:29','If Pakistan cannot control the killer forces with its borders then India has an obligation  as the government of all its people to do so. This would not be territorial invasion but an act of self defense.'),(37830,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/StoryPage.aspx?sectionName=ViewsSectionPage&id=ca0ddccc-f725-4957-91c7-5ba0f568b371&&Headline=No+place+to+hide','guest9239','2008-12-02 18:03:22','If Pakistan cannot control the killer forces with its borders then India has an obligation  as the government of all its people to do so. This would not be territorial invasion but an act of self defenseree out of four people \nat the ths th. It seem'),(37831,'www.hindustantimes.com/StoryPage/FullcoverageStoryPage.aspx?id=4cc65f1d-24c0-486a-a5b6-b60ed5a87514Mumbaiunderattack_Special&&Headline=Diplomacy+to+make+Pakistan+hand+over+terrorists?','guest1000','2008-12-02 18:45:09','Indian Media is behind. Pakistani President Zardari already told on Larry King Live that the list provided by India is only a list of names and not terrorists. He said unless they investigate and find evidence against these men on the list, they cant call them terrorists. He said if evidence is found against these men, Pakistan will try them in their own country and not hand them over to India'),(37832,'dogtimemedia.com','bridges','2008-12-02 19:27:01','hi'),(37833,'dogtimemedia.com','bridges','2008-12-02 19:27:35','bye');
